(2614480, 362210, 5391, '<td valign="top">Holy cow.  Interesting color choice that I would not have thought of, but it works really well. 10</td>', 'Holy cow.  Interesting color choice that I would not have thought of, but it works really well. 10', '2006-07-12 11:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
