(2615086, 360554, 35947, '<td valign="top">Vibrant colors!  I almost missed the ball trail.  I''d suggest maybe a bit more crop''d off the top. 7</td>', 'Vibrant colors!  I almost missed the ball trail.  I''d suggest maybe a bit more crop''d off the top. 7', '2006-07-12 14:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615089, 361315, 30637, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2006-07-12 14:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615090, 361548, 35947, '<td valign="top">Nice colors/composition.  Unique view.</td>', 'Nice colors/composition.  Unique view.', '2006-07-12 14:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615094, 361531, 30637, '<td valign="top">Library or courthouse</td>', 'Library or courthouse', '2006-07-12 14:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615097, 360693, 59130, '<td valign="top">Great picture - love the colours.  I think you should have been a fraction further to the right though when taking the shot, e.g. the vertical bar just above the cross doesn''t quite point to the centre of the cross.  In an image that relies heavily on the perspective, it would have been more striking if it was spot on (I have exactly the same problem with my entry by the way!!)</td>', 'Great picture - love the colours.  I think you should have been a fraction further to the right though when taking the shot, e.g. the vertical bar just above the cross doesn''t quite point to the centre of the cross.  In an image that relies heavily on the perspective, it would have been more striking if it was spot on (I have exactly the same problem with my entry by the way!!)', '2006-07-12 14:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615098, 360955, 35947, '<td valign="top">Nice vanishing point shot, other then that not much "pop/wow factor" IMHO.</td>', 'Nice vanishing point shot, other then that not much "pop/wow factor" IMHO.', '2006-07-12 14:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615101, 362004, 30637, '<td valign="top">Wow! Awesome image!</td>', 'Wow! Awesome image!', '2006-07-12 14:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615103, 359764, 59130, '<td valign="top">I really like this - great composition, and the children looking in opposite directions adds interest to the shot - it wouldn''t have been nearly as good without them.  One of my favourites.</td>', 'I really like this - great composition, and the children looking in opposite directions adds interest to the shot - it wouldn''t have been nearly as good without them.  One of my favourites.', '2006-07-12 14:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615104, 359625, 35947, '<td valign="top">Unique shot.  A lot going on and no one thing really draws the eye in IMHO.</td>', 'Unique shot.  A lot going on and no one thing really draws the eye in IMHO.', '2006-07-12 14:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615105, 362078, 49326, '<td valign="top">Wow, weird DOF. I like it though. I love the deep blacks.</td>', 'Wow, weird DOF. I like it though. I love the deep blacks.', '2006-07-12 14:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615106, 362354, 30637, '<td valign="top">The title makes it work!</td>', 'The title makes it work!', '2006-07-12 14:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615108, 362115, 35947, '<td valign="top">Most definately a unique perspective!  Can''t think many see eye level with one of these animals!</td>', 'Most definately a unique perspective!  Can''t think many see eye level with one of these animals!', '2006-07-12 14:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615117, 361684, 35947, '<td valign="top">Subject isn''t the most interesting and I''d crop the background off the top.<br/>Just my opinion though.</td>', 'Subject isn''t the most interesting and I''d crop the background off the top.Just my opinion though.', '2006-07-12 14:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615121, 359968, 59130, '<td valign="top">This is a strange image.  I think it could have been improved by not cropping quite so tightly at the top and by using some fill flash to light the boy''s face.  His expression is a little odd and his stance isn''t very appealing either - he looks uncomfortable, and it makes me as the viewer feel uncomfortable.  The centre of the picture is too bare, and you end up looking from one boy to the other, not quite sure where to rest your gaze.  Also - what exactly does this have to do with perspective?!</td>', 'This is a strange image.  I think it could have been improved by not cropping quite so tightly at the top and by using some fill flash to light the boy''s face.  His expression is a little odd and his stance isn''t very appealing either - he looks uncomfortable, and it makes me as the viewer feel uncomfortable.  The centre of the picture is too bare, and you end up looking from one boy to the other, not quite sure where to rest your gaze.  Also - what exactly does this have to do with perspective?!', '2006-07-12 14:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615122, 362126, 35947, '<td valign="top">Well composed.  Not much "wow" factor IMHO though.  This is how most would view/see from this perspective.</td>', 'Well composed.  Not much "wow" factor IMHO though.  This is how most would view/see from this perspective.', '2006-07-12 14:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615125, 362078, 59130, '<td valign="top">Great image - love the b&amp;w here</td>', 'Great image - love the b&w here', '2006-07-12 14:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615129, 360343, 61125, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the border, never-the-less, great pic</td>', 'Not a fan of the border, never-the-less, great pic', '2006-07-12 14:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615136, 361366, 59130, '<td valign="top">I like this - nice colours and a little bit different from the other shots I have seen so far.  What I don''t like about it, however, is the border - I don''t think it adds anything.  In fact, I think it takes away from the "endless" feel you are trying to create - you have contained the image within the border which is wrong here.</td>', 'I like this - nice colours and a little bit different from the other shots I have seen so far.  What I don''t like about it, however, is the border - I don''t think it adds anything.  In fact, I think it takes away from the "endless" feel you are trying to create - you have contained the image within the border which is wrong here.', '2006-07-12 14:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615142, 361208, 59130, '<td valign="top">I guess this is technically good, but it is far too over-processed for my taste.</td>', 'I guess this is technically good, but it is far too over-processed for my taste.', '2006-07-12 14:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615144, 362168, 47704, '<td valign="top">Wow, this could be the Brownie winner.  Absolutely HORRIBLE!!!</td>', 'Wow, this could be the Brownie winner.  Absolutely HORRIBLE!!!', '2006-07-12 14:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615150, 361728, 59130, '<td valign="top">Nice idea - the first attempt I have come across at showing perspectives on size.  The colours are a little dull.  House is nice and sharp</td>', 'Nice idea - the first attempt I have come across at showing perspectives on size.  The colours are a little dull.  House is nice and sharp', '2006-07-12 15:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615152, 362150, 35947, '<td valign="top">Great and unique perspective!  I''m not sure everyone will "see" it as a bottle w/ 1/2 naked (?) person in background.  Good luck!</td>', 'Great and unique perspective!  I''m not sure everyone will "see" it as a bottle w/ 1/2 naked (?) person in background.  Good luck!', '2006-07-12 15:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615161, 362210, 55199, '<td valign="top">Otherworldly; interesting effect.</td>', 'Otherworldly; interesting effect.', '2006-07-12 15:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615166, 362439, 35947, '<td valign="top">Wonderful scene.  I LIKE the slight tilt to the horizon (I''m sure you''ll hear different!)  the colors in the sky/water seem kind of flat though IMHO.</td>', 'Wonderful scene.  I LIKE the slight tilt to the horizon (I''m sure you''ll hear different!)  the colors in the sky/water seem kind of flat though IMHO.', '2006-07-12 15:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615178, 360889, 35947, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and fade to black!  He doesn''t look to happy to have a camera in his face.  Hope he didn''t bite! 8</td>', 'Nice DOF and fade to black!  He doesn''t look to happy to have a camera in his face.  Hope he didn''t bite! 8', '2006-07-12 15:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615183, 361074, 55199, '<td valign="top">Interesting symmetry; The lighting is a little harsh though.</td>', 'Interesting symmetry; The lighting is a little harsh though.', '2006-07-12 15:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615188, 362256, 55199, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.</td>', 'Nice colors.', '2006-07-12 15:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615194, 362526, 35947, '<td valign="top">Wonderful job!  Nice and sharp with the DOF in the background really makes her eyes stand out IMO.  (WAY Off topic: I think her wedding rings are almost exactly the same as my set!  That deserves a bump, right?) 9</td>', 'Wonderful job!  Nice and sharp with the DOF in the background really makes her eyes stand out IMO.  (WAY Off topic: I think her wedding rings are almost exactly the same as my set!  That deserves a bump, right?) 9', '2006-07-12 15:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615201, 361587, 55199, '<td valign="top">Lovely landscape.  I wish the foreground were a little lighter.</td>', 'Lovely landscape.  I wish the foreground were a little lighter.', '2006-07-12 15:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615202, 360813, 35947, '<td valign="top">Image seems a little grainy and colors a little washed out.  Converting to a grey scale might help.</td>', 'Image seems a little grainy and colors a little washed out.  Converting to a grey scale might help.', '2006-07-12 15:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615212, 362505, 35947, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Very creative/unique.  Suggestion that would improve this (IMHO): faster shutter speed so the fish wasn''t blurry and not such a centered shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Very creative/unique.  Suggestion that would improve this (IMHO): faster shutter speed so the fish wasn''t blurry and not such a centered shot.', '2006-07-12 15:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615216, 361157, 35947, '<td valign="top">Most unique and interesting building!  A very cool shot.  Can''t think of much to improve it, sorry!</td>', 'Most unique and interesting building!  A very cool shot.  Can''t think of much to improve it, sorry!', '2006-07-12 15:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615221, 362150, 16402, '<td valign="top">Took me a minute to get it, but very nice intepretation.</td>', 'Took me a minute to get it, but very nice intepretation.', '2006-07-12 15:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615224, 362215, 55199, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  However, the focus seems a little soft and the bottom right windows are a little distracting.  Good angle though... definitely gives the feeling of great height.</td>', 'Nice colors.  However, the focus seems a little soft and the bottom right windows are a little distracting.  Good angle though... definitely gives the feeling of great height.', '2006-07-12 15:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615225, 362251, 35947, '<td valign="top">Extra point for adding humor and making think I''M looking through beer goggles with the light trails!</td>', 'Extra point for adding humor and making think I''M looking through beer goggles with the light trails!', '2006-07-12 15:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615234, 362417, 35947, '<td valign="top">Nice use of negative space.</td>', 'Nice use of negative space.', '2006-07-12 15:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615242, 362439, 55199, '<td valign="top">A little blurry.</td>', 'A little blurry.', '2006-07-12 15:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615246, 362457, 16402, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and pretty good composition. IMHO I''d like to see the flower positioned just a bit higher up the slope, but that''s a minor artistic judgement. Good Job.</td>', 'Nice colors and pretty good composition. IMHO I''d like to see the flower positioned just a bit higher up the slope, but that''s a minor artistic judgement. Good Job.', '2006-07-12 15:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615251, 361074, 16402, '<td valign="top">Lighting sure is harsh. Might have been better at a different time of day.</td>', 'Lighting sure is harsh. Might have been better at a different time of day.', '2006-07-12 15:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615253, 362324, 35947, '<td valign="top">Nice use of b/w tone.  Personally, I''d crop a little more off the right to keep the focus on your main subject/line.</td>', 'Nice use of b/w tone.  Personally, I''d crop a little more off the right to keep the focus on your main subject/line.', '2006-07-12 15:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615268, 361930, 35947, '<td valign="top">And a wonderful use of light and shadows!  I''m not sure on the composition here though.  It feels unbalanced to me.</td>', 'And a wonderful use of light and shadows!  I''m not sure on the composition here though.  It feels unbalanced to me.', '2006-07-12 15:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615272, 362321, 55199, '<td valign="top">Telephone lines/poles are distracting.  Lovely colors.</td>', 'Telephone lines/poles are distracting.  Lovely colors.', '2006-07-12 15:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615284, 360831, 35947, '<td valign="top">I love the lonely "feeling" of this shot and how you gave it such depth with the figure on the rock staring out to sea.  Wish the other person wasn''t standing there though.</td>', 'I love the lonely "feeling" of this shot and how you gave it such depth with the figure on the rock staring out to sea.  Wish the other person wasn''t standing there though.', '2006-07-12 15:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615291, 362380, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice. I like the dark imagery here.</td>', 'Nice. I like the dark imagery here.', '2006-07-12 15:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615294, 362356, 55199, '<td valign="top">Interesting. :)  I wish the claws on the left were included in the image.</td>', 'Interesting. :)  I wish the claws on the left were included in the image.', '2006-07-12 15:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615310, 361865, 55199, '<td valign="top">I like your placement of the person.  Composition is nice.  Wish the town lights weren''t there, but still a lovely photo.</td>', 'I like your placement of the person.  Composition is nice.  Wish the town lights weren''t there, but still a lovely photo.', '2006-07-12 15:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615313, 361079, 35947, '<td valign="top">1st impression:  WoW!  What a great shot!  Thanks for sharing!  10</td>', '1st impression:  WoW!  What a great shot!  Thanks for sharing!  10', '2006-07-12 15:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615319, 362509, 55199, '<td valign="top">B/W is great for this; it really sets the mood.</td>', 'B/W is great for this; it really sets the mood.', '2006-07-12 15:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615325, 362374, 55199, '<td valign="top">I don''t really understand this, sorry.</td>', 'I don''t really understand this, sorry.', '2006-07-12 15:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615330, 359811, 35947, '<td valign="top">Wonderful scene!  Love the flow of the water!  Might have a little too much crop''d off the top (lost the building top and 1 mast).  9</td>', 'Wonderful scene!  Love the flow of the water!  Might have a little too much crop''d off the top (lost the building top and 1 mast).  9', '2006-07-12 15:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2615339, 361603, 35947, '<td valign="top">Love this!  What a cute pup and a great expression on his/her face!  Those ears!</td>', 'Love this!  What a cute pup and a great expression on his/her face!  Those ears!', '2006-07-12 15:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
