(2615356, 362375, 55199, '<td valign="top">Thats one hairy moon!  My first reaction is "Ewww." The hind side of a gorilla(?) isn''t exactly appealing to most humans (at least I hope not!). Is she pregnant? As far as technicals... the lighting is a little harsh, but composition and color are good.</td>', 'Thats one hairy moon!  My first reaction is "Ewww." The hind side of a gorilla(?) isn''t exactly appealing to most humans (at least I hope not!). Is she pregnant? As far as technicals... the lighting is a little harsh, but composition and color are good.', '2006-07-12 15:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
