(2615417, 361634, 34857, '<td valign="top">For some reason, my brain had a bit of time wrapping around this one. At first glance, nothing much, but it certainly begs for a second look. Very.... intruiging. Nice!</td>', 'For some reason, my brain had a bit of time wrapping around this one. At first glance, nothing much, but it certainly begs for a second look. Very.... intruiging. Nice!', '2006-07-12 16:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
