(2616303, 358767, 62041, '<td valign="top">this is pretty funny. i like the idea. and i can say i have never even thought about how incoming traffic looks to soon-to-be roadkill. <br/>the background is really light - it''s kind of hard to see the tire - now that i look at it, the light is really light. it makes the dark kind of fuzzy where it touches. nice creativity.</td>', 'this is pretty funny. i like the idea. and i can say i have never even thought about how incoming traffic looks to soon-to-be roadkill. the background is really light - it''s kind of hard to see the tire - now that i look at it, the light is really light. it makes the dark kind of fuzzy where it touches. nice creativity.', '2006-07-12 20:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
