(2616318, 362238, 62041, '<td valign="top">this is a great idea ... i love all the lines in this photo. and the sky looks awesome. it''s the contrast of the of the lines and the swirling clouds. also, i love the color scheme - it''s almost mono-chronomatic. the photo is clear -- this shows perspective in so many ways. it''s one of my favorites... good job.</td>', 'this is a great idea ... i love all the lines in this photo. and the sky looks awesome. it''s the contrast of the of the lines and the swirling clouds. also, i love the color scheme - it''s almost mono-chronomatic. the photo is clear -- this shows perspective in so many ways. it''s one of my favorites... good job.', '2006-07-12 20:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
