(2617272, 361684, 59343, '<td valign="top">As much as I appreciate the effort at being creative and abstract, this picture is dizzying.  Part of the fabric (or whatever this is) is blown out on the right side and the colors are a bit flat.  Also, with regards to DOF--there doesn''t seem to be much in focus to contrast with OOF in a shallow DOF.</td>', 'As much as I appreciate the effort at being creative and abstract, this picture is dizzying.  Part of the fabric (or whatever this is) is blown out on the right side and the colors are a bit flat.  Also, with regards to DOF--there doesn''t seem to be much in focus to contrast with OOF in a shallow DOF.', '2006-07-13 01:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2617282, 362369, 59343, '<td valign="top">WOW, I love this photo.  I think it would work very well for the Lines challenge too--if the timing had been right.  Nice contrast between the lines of the dunes.  The sky has a bizarre coloration that seems to work nicely here.  I think the colors might be a bit flat (for DPC likings anyway), but the composition is perfect.  Nice job.</td>', 'WOW, I love this photo.  I think it would work very well for the Lines challenge too--if the timing had been right.  Nice contrast between the lines of the dunes.  The sky has a bizarre coloration that seems to work nicely here.  I think the colors might be a bit flat (for DPC likings anyway), but the composition is perfect.  Nice job.', '2006-07-13 01:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2617287, 360325, 59343, '<td valign="top">ok...nice creative attempt.  The moon needs to be in better focus I think in order to really make this shot better.  I do like the coloration though.</td>', 'ok...nice creative attempt.  The moon needs to be in better focus I think in order to really make this shot better.  I do like the coloration though.', '2006-07-13 01:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2617291, 362219, 59343, '<td valign="top">nice job at a new perspective.  The coloration of the skin tones don''t appear to be all that realistic though.  I think with a bit more "vibrant" colors the reflection would stand out better.</td>', 'nice job at a new perspective.  The coloration of the skin tones don''t appear to be all that realistic though.  I think with a bit more "vibrant" colors the reflection would stand out better.', '2006-07-13 01:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2617307, 360829, 59343, '<td valign="top">I have to say this is a beautiful, simple image.  Nice colors and contrast between sky, barn and grass.  The composition seems to be "lacking" somehow for me, but overall it''s a nice image.</td>', 'I have to say this is a beautiful, simple image.  Nice colors and contrast between sky, barn and grass.  The composition seems to be "lacking" somehow for me, but overall it''s a nice image.', '2006-07-13 01:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
