(2617325, 360806, 50289, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  I had to look twice to find the camera.  Too bad you didn''t move your leg over just a bit to hide the tripod leg.  Your camera is somewhat hidden in the dark over your shoulder.  Well done!</td>', 'Great shot!  I had to look twice to find the camera.  Too bad you didn''t move your leg over just a bit to hide the tripod leg.  Your camera is somewhat hidden in the dark over your shoulder.  Well done!', '2006-07-13 01:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2617372, 362181, 50289, '<td valign="top">I would like to have seen a slightly different perspective (seeing that this is what the challenge is).  This is just another bridge shot.  Your greens are nice but it appears that this bright green is more from editing than a natural green (due to the green tint in the bridge itself).  Also, I think it would have looked better with a deeper DOF so the entire bridge was in focus (just my preference).</td>', 'I would like to have seen a slightly different perspective (seeing that this is what the challenge is).  This is just another bridge shot.  Your greens are nice but it appears that this bright green is more from editing than a natural green (due to the green tint in the bridge itself).  Also, I think it would have looked better with a deeper DOF so the entire bridge was in focus (just my preference).', '2006-07-13 01:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2617403, 362539, 50289, '<td valign="top">The whole picture seems tipped to the left.  Also, everything except the light and arch at the top of the picture are slightly out of focus.  In a shot like this, my preference would be a deep DOF so that all the arches are in focus.</td>', 'The whole picture seems tipped to the left.  Also, everything except the light and arch at the top of the picture are slightly out of focus.  In a shot like this, my preference would be a deep DOF so that all the arches are in focus.', '2006-07-13 02:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
