(2618184, 362343, 27482, '<td valign="top">I like the skin tonality of this shot, just a little too low key for my taste and blends too easily in with the backround, wish it were either darker or lighter than the model as she blends in too much for my taste.  Anyway, enough negativity, I like this shot and think it´s well composed and definately some potential, keep at it!  7 from me.</td>', 'I like the skin tonality of this shot, just a little too low key for my taste and blends too easily in with the backround, wish it were either darker or lighter than the model as she blends in too much for my taste.  Anyway, enough negativity, I like this shot and think it´s well composed and definately some potential, keep at it!  7 from me.', '2006-07-13 09:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
