(2618194, 362438, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice, but where is the ball that is going down?  This shot would have been so much stronger if it were, it´s kindof dull and uninteresting as it is, would have been soo cool if you had taken this with a relatively long shutterspeed, had a ball in there and had it motion blurred but still visibly a basketball, THAT is the potential I see in this shot.  Sorry to bust your balls like this, pun intended :)</td>', 'Nice, but where is the ball that is going down?  This shot would have been so much stronger if it were, it´s kindof dull and uninteresting as it is, would have been soo cool if you had taken this with a relatively long shutterspeed, had a ball in there and had it motion blurred but still visibly a basketball, THAT is the potential I see in this shot.  Sorry to bust your balls like this, pun intended :)', '2006-07-13 09:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
