(2618239, 362081, 47534, '<td valign="top">Wow - I just got off MY bike &amp; walked into the office a little while ago...yes, this definitely changes one''s perspective!  I have sat here for ten minutes trying to type all the emotions this creates, but they won''t all fit on the page.  Most of all - "Did he make it, or was there a funeral for someone''s wife and children to attend?"  Thank you for creating such a powerful image...</td>', 'Wow - I just got off MY bike & walked into the office a little while ago...yes, this definitely changes one''s perspective!  I have sat here for ten minutes trying to type all the emotions this creates, but they won''t all fit on the page.  Most of all - "Did he make it, or was there a funeral for someone''s wife and children to attend?"  Thank you for creating such a powerful image...', '2006-07-13 09:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
