(2618274, 361571, 61679, '<td valign="top">With the angle you shot this from, it is really hard to distinquish there are pews in the background.  It is also difficult to tell if this was taken from behind the alter or from a kneeler in front of the alter.  It also appears that you may have taken this at a slow shutter speed, as the image appears to suffer from a little camera shake.</td>', 'With the angle you shot this from, it is really hard to distinquish there are pews in the background.  It is also difficult to tell if this was taken from behind the alter or from a kneeler in front of the alter.  It also appears that you may have taken this at a slow shutter speed, as the image appears to suffer from a little camera shake.', '2006-07-13 10:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
