(2618312, 361930, 61679, '<td valign="top">The colors in this image are wonderful and the silhouette is nicely done.  However, the wire and towers above the bridge really hurt this image and the angle of the left tower looks a little odd.  If you clone these items out after the challenge, this could be a very powerful image.</td>', 'The colors in this image are wonderful and the silhouette is nicely done.  However, the wire and towers above the bridge really hurt this image and the angle of the left tower looks a little odd.  If you clone these items out after the challenge, this could be a very powerful image.', '2006-07-13 10:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2618320, 362181, 61679, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective you took of this bridge but the overall green hue is a bit overwhelming.  You might want to consider changing this to a b&amp;w image and play with the contrast a little bit.  This image has so much potential.</td>', 'I like the perspective you took of this bridge but the overall green hue is a bit overwhelming.  You might want to consider changing this to a b&w image and play with the contrast a little bit.  This image has so much potential.', '2006-07-13 10:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
