(2618855, 359378, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not really selling me this shot at all and frankly it´s because of the title.  I never normally let them affect my vote but here I honestly can say I would have enjoyed this photo better if the title were more appropriate as it´s extremelly obvious that this isn´t shot in flight.  If there was just a hint of the rotors moving, this would have been an awesome shot.  I still like this shot though, don´t get me wrong and I really like the composition and tonal range in it, especially in the body of the plane so it got a 7 from me.</td>', 'Not really selling me this shot at all and frankly it´s because of the title.  I never normally let them affect my vote but here I honestly can say I would have enjoyed this photo better if the title were more appropriate as it´s extremelly obvious that this isn´t shot in flight.  If there was just a hint of the rotors moving, this would have been an awesome shot.  I still like this shot though, don´t get me wrong and I really like the composition and tonal range in it, especially in the body of the plane so it got a 7 from me.', '2006-07-13 13:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
