(2619039, 362308, 27482, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool but I think I would have liked it better had you used a bigger aperture or longer lens or whatever you needed to do to make the DOF shallower, the reason I am saying so is that this shot is too busy for my taste and the butterfly and sun don´t stand out as much as they could do if that were not the case.  LOVE the composition though, nice work on that one :)  6 from me.</td>', 'This is pretty cool but I think I would have liked it better had you used a bigger aperture or longer lens or whatever you needed to do to make the DOF shallower, the reason I am saying so is that this shot is too busy for my taste and the butterfly and sun don´t stand out as much as they could do if that were not the case.  LOVE the composition though, nice work on that one :)  6 from me.', '2006-07-13 14:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2619043, 362491, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool!  Normally I detest noise but here it actually adds something to the shot.  I am not really all that fond of the blurred foreground in the picture and would rather see more at the top instead of it, had you placed the "splashes" in the lower corners as per say the rule of thirds I would have liked the composition better.  Anyway, nice shot and I like the oily noisy look of this, got a 7 from me.</td>', 'Pretty cool!  Normally I detest noise but here it actually adds something to the shot.  I am not really all that fond of the blurred foreground in the picture and would rather see more at the top instead of it, had you placed the "splashes" in the lower corners as per say the rule of thirds I would have liked the composition better.  Anyway, nice shot and I like the oily noisy look of this, got a 7 from me.', '2006-07-13 14:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
