(2619291, 361071, 27524, '<td valign="top">Not bad at all... Really like how you fitted all in your angle. Colors also pretty cute.</td>', 'Not bad at all... Really like how you fitted all in your angle. Colors also pretty cute.', '2006-07-13 15:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
