(2619310, 361380, 40323, '<td valign="top">Great macro, like the colors and bokeh.  However, it doesn''t really utilize perspective IMO.</td>', 'Great macro, like the colors and bokeh.  However, it doesn''t really utilize perspective IMO.', '2006-07-13 15:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2619313, 361432, 54778, '<td valign="top">Omg what did you do.. lovely shot and composition (from what I can make out) but baaaaaaaaaaad lighting... <br/>This could have been doing so well if not for the light..Seriously this shot has great potential with just a little bit of photoshop</td>', 'Omg what did you do.. lovely shot and composition (from what I can make out) but baaaaaaaaaaad lighting... This could have been doing so well if not for the light..Seriously this shot has great potential with just a little bit of photoshop', '2006-07-13 16:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2619315, 361717, 27524, '<td valign="top">Its pretty stiley b&amp;w...well done. Somehow I feel like the long shape for this picture would work bit better.</td>', 'Its pretty stiley b&w...well done. Somehow I feel like the long shape for this picture would work bit better.', '2006-07-13 16:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2619319, 361930, 40323, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  However, IMO it doesn''t utilize perspective enough to create a dramatic effect.</td>', 'Nice colors.  However, IMO it doesn''t utilize perspective enough to create a dramatic effect.', '2006-07-13 16:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2619326, 360343, 27524, '<td valign="top">Goshh...the bee looks like ninja before final hit ;).<br/>Impressive catch. Of course would look more smooth if there would be just one flower but yes... Fine work anyway.</td>', 'Goshh...the bee looks like ninja before final hit ;).Impressive catch. Of course would look more smooth if there would be just one flower but yes... Fine work anyway.', '2006-07-13 16:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2619328, 361079, 40323, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, I like the flipped-over composition.  Definitely an outside-the-box interpretion of perspective that wins points with me.</td>', 'Cool shot, I like the flipped-over composition.  Definitely an outside-the-box interpretion of perspective that wins points with me.', '2006-07-13 16:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2619330, 360557, 54778, '<td valign="top">good focus with clear shot</td>', 'good focus with clear shot', '2006-07-13 16:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2619333, 361528, 27524, '<td valign="top">Fine b&amp;w... just small detail. I would cropped of that little horizontal part from bottom.</td>', 'Fine b&w... just small detail. I would cropped of that little horizontal part from bottom.', '2006-07-13 16:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2619337, 360991, 40323, '<td valign="top">Good B&amp;W contrast, DOF and composition.  The off-center border takes some getting used to though.</td>', 'Good B&W contrast, DOF and composition.  The off-center border takes some getting used to though.', '2006-07-13 16:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2619342, 361157, 54778, '<td valign="top">Very good shot though I would have like you to work on the light a little. I know its hard with the sun so sharp but you could got a bit up and down on the scales in photoshop etc.</td>', 'Very good shot though I would have like you to work on the light a little. I know its hard with the sun so sharp but you could got a bit up and down on the scales in photoshop etc.', '2006-07-13 16:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2619343, 362523, 40323, '<td valign="top">Great sharpness and details.</td>', 'Great sharpness and details.', '2006-07-13 16:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
