(2619482, 362417, 39598, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge brief:</b> - <i>Use perspective to create a dramatic effect with your photograph.</i> <br/><b>Perspective</b> - <i>The appearance of things relative to one another as determined by their distance from the viewer.</i> <br/> <br/>For a discussion on perspective check out <a href="//mathforum.org/sum95/math_and/perspective/perspect.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this</a> article or <a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Perspective_%28visual%29" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this</a> one, or for something a bit heavier check out <a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Perspective_%28graphical%29" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this</a> one.</td>', 'Challenge brief: - Use perspective to create a dramatic effect with your photograph. Perspective - The appearance of things relative to one another as determined by their distance from the viewer.  For a discussion on perspective check out this article or this one, or for something a bit heavier check out this one.', '2006-07-13 16:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
