(2619505, 361956, 39598, '<td valign="top">I wonder when last a holiday snap, shot through someone''s windshield, featured in the top 10?</td>', 'I wonder when last a holiday snap, shot through someone''s windshield, featured in the top 10?', '2006-07-13 17:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2619508, 361729, 57381, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1/1<br/>Lighting: 0/2<br/>Focus: 1/2<br/>Creativity: 1/2<br/>Aesthetics: 1/3 <br/> <br/>The idea is okay, but there''s some hazing/noise around almost all the edges. The sky also has some noise in it overall, and the actual net/hoop itself is rendered flat due to the lighting. I like the angle and concept, but perhaps using flash either bounced off a white card or softened with some tissue would bring out some of the muted details and make them sharper.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1/1Lighting: 0/2Focus: 1/2Creativity: 1/2Aesthetics: 1/3  The idea is okay, but there''s some hazing/noise around almost all the edges. The sky also has some noise in it overall, and the actual net/hoop itself is rendered flat due to the lighting. I like the angle and concept, but perhaps using flash either bounced off a white card or softened with some tissue would bring out some of the muted details and make them sharper.', '2006-07-13 17:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2619510, 361744, 40973, '<td valign="top">.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-08-17 11:07:32.</i></td>', '.', '2006-07-13 17:04:18.000000', '2006-08-17 12:07:32.000000', 1),
(2619512, 361614, 57381, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1/1<br/>Lighting: 1/2<br/>Focus: 1/2<br/>Creativity: 1/2<br/>Aesthetics: 1/3 <br/> <br/>I like the composition and placement in this photo, but the blur seems a little unnatural to me outside of what you''d get with standard shallow depth of field.<br/> <br/>I like the overall idea and feel.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1/1Lighting: 1/2Focus: 1/2Creativity: 1/2Aesthetics: 1/3  I like the composition and placement in this photo, but the blur seems a little unnatural to me outside of what you''d get with standard shallow depth of field. I like the overall idea and feel.', '2006-07-13 17:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
