(2619520, 362210, 39598, '<td valign="top">This is stunning!<br/>I certainly hope you win it!</td>', 'This is stunning!I certainly hope you win it!', '2006-07-13 17:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2619524, 361648, 57381, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1/1<br/>Lighting: 0/2<br/>Focus: 1/2<br/>Creativity: 1/2<br/>Aesthetics: 1/3 <br/> <br/>The idea is good, it does a good job of identifying the title. The subject is not lit properly however, and it detracts from the photo quite a bit. Her entire face and arm are shadowed. I''d like to see this photo with some fill in flash. Don''t be afraid to use flash outdoors, it will remove harsh shadows under the eyes, nose, lips and chin in mid day sun. It will also help in situations like this, where the sky is bright, but the subject itself looks as though they are in a shadow.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1/1Lighting: 0/2Focus: 1/2Creativity: 1/2Aesthetics: 1/3  The idea is good, it does a good job of identifying the title. The subject is not lit properly however, and it detracts from the photo quite a bit. Her entire face and arm are shadowed. I''d like to see this photo with some fill in flash. Don''t be afraid to use flash outdoors, it will remove harsh shadows under the eyes, nose, lips and chin in mid day sun. It will also help in situations like this, where the sky is bright, but the subject itself looks as though they are in a shadow.', '2006-07-13 17:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2619526, 362338, 57381, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1/1<br/>Lighting: 1/2<br/>Focus: 1/2<br/>Creativity: 1/2<br/>Aesthetics: 1/3 <br/> <br/>For me this photo is okay, but could have been better. It appears as though the camera was simply tilted, and results in a diagonal perspective. I like the photo overall, but would have appreciated the lines of the bright better if it were straight with the  horizon. The colours seem a bit washed out in areas as well, perhaps a bit higher aperture and a bit longer shutterspeed.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1/1Lighting: 1/2Focus: 1/2Creativity: 1/2Aesthetics: 1/3  For me this photo is okay, but could have been better. It appears as though the camera was simply tilted, and results in a diagonal perspective. I like the photo overall, but would have appreciated the lines of the bright better if it were straight with the  horizon. The colours seem a bit washed out in areas as well, perhaps a bit higher aperture and a bit longer shutterspeed.', '2006-07-13 17:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2619528, 362129, 39598, '<td valign="top">Nice job here!</td>', 'Nice job here!', '2006-07-13 17:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
