(2619535, 361938, 57381, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1/1<br/>Lighting: 2/2<br/>Focus: 1/2<br/>Creativity: 1/2<br/>Aesthetics: 2/3 <br/> <br/>I love the shadows from the pillars. I would have loved it even more if they were even more stark and longer. I bet this photo in the evening with the sun going down would look even better, with long moody shadows in the long moody hallways.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1/1Lighting: 2/2Focus: 1/2Creativity: 1/2Aesthetics: 2/3  I love the shadows from the pillars. I would have loved it even more if they were even more stark and longer. I bet this photo in the evening with the sun going down would look even better, with long moody shadows in the long moody hallways.', '2006-07-13 17:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
