(2619542, 362167, 57381, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1/1<br/>Lighting: 1/2<br/>Focus: 1/2<br/>Creativity: 1/2<br/>Aesthetics: 2/3 <br/> <br/>I like the dirction and flow of this photo quite a bit. I''d love to see a photo with shadows cast at an angle, early morning or later in the day. Railroad tracks always offer such interesting lines, I love seeing them with interesting shadows.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1/1Lighting: 1/2Focus: 1/2Creativity: 1/2Aesthetics: 2/3  I like the dirction and flow of this photo quite a bit. I''d love to see a photo with shadows cast at an angle, early morning or later in the day. Railroad tracks always offer such interesting lines, I love seeing them with interesting shadows.', '2006-07-13 17:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2619544, 359240, 57381, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1/1<br/>Lighting: 1/2<br/>Focus: 1/2<br/>Creativity: 1/2<br/>Aesthetics: 1/3</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1/1Lighting: 1/2Focus: 1/2Creativity: 1/2Aesthetics: 1/3', '2006-07-13 17:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2619561, 362369, 57381, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1/1<br/>Lighting: 2/2<br/>Focus: 1/2<br/>Creativity: 1/2<br/>Aesthetics: 2/3</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1/1Lighting: 2/2Focus: 1/2Creativity: 1/2Aesthetics: 2/3', '2006-07-13 17:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2619568, 361686, 57381, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1/1<br/>Lighting: 1/2<br/>Focus: 1/2<br/>Creativity: 1/2<br/>Aesthetics: 1/3 <br/> <br/>The shadows are a bit too stark in this photo for me. The whites are generally overexposed and the blacks underexposed. Perhaps adjusting the white balance would help to even things out a little bit.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1/1Lighting: 1/2Focus: 1/2Creativity: 1/2Aesthetics: 1/3  The shadows are a bit too stark in this photo for me. The whites are generally overexposed and the blacks underexposed. Perhaps adjusting the white balance would help to even things out a little bit.', '2006-07-13 17:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2619570, 361603, 39598, '<td valign="top">He''s KEEUWT!<br/>It has absolutely nothing to do with perspective; but he''s cute.<br/> <br/><b>Challenge brief:</b> - <i>Use perspective to create a dramatic effect with your photograph.</i> <br/> <br/><b>Perspective</b> - <i>The appearance of things relative to one another as determined by their distance from the viewer.</i> <br/> <br/>For a discussion on perspective check out <a href="//mathforum.org/sum95/math_and/perspective/perspect.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this</a> article or <a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Perspective_%28visual%29" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this</a> one, or for something a bit heavier check out <a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Perspective_%28graphical%29" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this</a> one.</td>', 'He''s KEEUWT!It has absolutely nothing to do with perspective; but he''s cute. Challenge brief: - Use perspective to create a dramatic effect with your photograph.  Perspective - The appearance of things relative to one another as determined by their distance from the viewer.  For a discussion on perspective check out this article or this one, or for something a bit heavier check out this one.', '2006-07-13 17:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2619576, 362230, 39598, '<td valign="top">Dude!<br/>My neck is out and it''s your fault!<br/>I''m gonna sue your lame ****!<br/>Ha!<br/>Good luck with this pic.</td>', 'Dude!My neck is out and it''s your fault!I''m gonna sue your lame ****!Ha!Good luck with this pic.', '2006-07-13 17:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2619581, 362373, 57381, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1/1<br/>Lighting: 1/2<br/>Focus: 1/2<br/>Creativity: 1/2<br/>Aesthetics: 2/3 <br/> <br/>Gotta love the intersting lines of a spiral staircase. Overall well done. Some small points... I might have moved the table entirely ouf of this picture, the placement seems to interrupt the general flow of the staircase, and the clutter on the table is distracting. The lamp also creates an unwanted change in the overall lighting in one small spot, so distracts me. The lighting overall seems to be daylight, probably mid day, as it is quite harsh. In the evening using interior lights only might have been better, more warm and moody. The house seems warm so I think accentuating that would have looked quite good. <br/> <br/>If not removing the table entirely, moving it to fit in with the curve a little more and moving most of the clutter, possibly leaving just the book and flowers.<br/> <br/>This looks like it was probably shot at a wedding and that the guestbook table, with name cards, some candles and possibly some treats on there as well. I think less would have been more in this case, but it probably wasn''t an option to go around moving things ;-)</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1/1Lighting: 1/2Focus: 1/2Creativity: 1/2Aesthetics: 2/3  Gotta love the intersting lines of a spiral staircase. Overall well done. Some small points... I might have moved the table entirely ouf of this picture, the placement seems to interrupt the general flow of the staircase, and the clutter on the table is distracting. The lamp also creates an unwanted change in the overall lighting in one small spot, so distracts me. The lighting overall seems to be daylight, probably mid day, as it is quite harsh. In the evening using interior lights only might have been better, more warm and moody. The house seems warm so I think accentuating that would have looked quite good.  If not removing the table entirely, moving it to fit in with the curve a little more and moving most of the clutter, possibly leaving just the book and flowers. This looks like it was probably shot at a wedding and that the guestbook table, with name cards, some candles and possibly some treats on there as well. I think less would have been more in this case, but it probably wasn''t an option to go around moving things ;-)', '2006-07-13 17:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2619594, 361603, 40973, '<td valign="top">.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-08-17 11:06:41.</i></td>', '.', '2006-07-13 17:30:07.000000', '2006-08-17 12:06:41.000000', 1),
(2619600, 362268, 57381, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge: 1/1<br/>Lighting: 1/2<br/>Focus: 1/2<br/>Creativity: 1/2<br/>Aesthetics: 1/3 <br/> <br/>The focus is this is nice and sharp. Overall it feels though like this was just on an automatic setting and a lucky snapshot at a swim meet or something. Don''t get me wrong, there''s nothing wrong with that. <br/> <br/>Shooting swimming pools is hard. Especially outdoors. The sun is harsh and unforgiving, creating horrible blown out reflections and the dreaded purple haze around the fringes of those reflections. A faster shutter speed would have helped with the blown out exposures.</td>', 'Meets Challenge: 1/1Lighting: 1/2Focus: 1/2Creativity: 1/2Aesthetics: 1/3  The focus is this is nice and sharp. Overall it feels though like this was just on an automatic setting and a lucky snapshot at a swim meet or something. Don''t get me wrong, there''s nothing wrong with that.  Shooting swimming pools is hard. Especially outdoors. The sun is harsh and unforgiving, creating horrible blown out reflections and the dreaded purple haze around the fringes of those reflections. A faster shutter speed would have helped with the blown out exposures.', '2006-07-13 17:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
