(2620457, 359597, 43400, '<td valign="top">great tones and hues--timelapsed to the point of seeing rotating stars, it just seems a little blurred, but overall i like it</td>', 'great tones and hues--timelapsed to the point of seeing rotating stars, it just seems a little blurred, but overall i like it', '2006-07-13 22:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2620459, 362354, 3607, '<td valign="top">interesting idea, but i don''t think it works.  if the cropping was a bit wider to show more of the road, and if the display panel were in focus but jumpy and the road and grass were all a blur, it would be a more effective picture (and that neither dial indicates much speed/power is being achieved . . . ;-)</td>', 'interesting idea, but i don''t think it works.  if the cropping was a bit wider to show more of the road, and if the display panel were in focus but jumpy and the road and grass were all a blur, it would be a more effective picture (and that neither dial indicates much speed/power is being achieved . . . ;-)', '2006-07-13 22:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2620460, 361159, 43400, '<td valign="top">rich black &amp; white tones like film print--nicely captured and great persp''ve</td>', 'rich black & white tones like film print--nicely captured and great persp''ve', '2006-07-13 22:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2620468, 360433, 43400, '<td valign="top">interesting, but hard to find any true perspective here. a wide angled lens would have worked or even a point-shooter with little depth of field to exxagerate the angle would also work--good colors, just a bit blurred. good potential overall.</td>', 'interesting, but hard to find any true perspective here. a wide angled lens would have worked or even a point-shooter with little depth of field to exxagerate the angle would also work--good colors, just a bit blurred. good potential overall.', '2006-07-13 22:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2620472, 362385, 51799, '<td valign="top">Neat close up</td>', 'Neat close up', '2006-07-13 22:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2620481, 362400, 3607, '<td valign="top">would have been much more powerful in black &amp; white.  overcast days don''t do well in color.</td>', 'would have been much more powerful in black & white.  overcast days don''t do well in color.', '2006-07-13 22:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2620570, 361800, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good perspective and nice colors.  Just wish the punk had a deeper dof/more focus, as seems to be on the others.</td>', '6 - Good perspective and nice colors.  Just wish the punk had a deeper dof/more focus, as seems to be on the others.', '2006-07-13 23:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2620654, 359185, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 -Nice perspective.  Nice bokeh.  If some of the fore flowers were in a little more focus (the oof ones distract/detract overall a little too much in my opinion), make this even better.  The colors perhaps tweaked a little too, although they''re nice soft like this as well.  Not sure on the frame.  Just noticed what looks like two hover flies at the bottom, perhaps if you were able, not cropping so tight down the bottom to include them, but they''d still be oof - opportune, of course.</td>', '6 -Nice perspective.  Nice bokeh.  If some of the fore flowers were in a little more focus (the oof ones distract/detract overall a little too much in my opinion), make this even better.  The colors perhaps tweaked a little too, although they''re nice soft like this as well.  Not sure on the frame.  Just noticed what looks like two hover flies at the bottom, perhaps if you were able, not cropping so tight down the bottom to include them, but they''d still be oof - opportune, of course.', '2006-07-13 23:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2620655, 361791, 59470, '<td valign="top">hey I know this place!!   excellent idea - great angle!<br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-19 08:16:23.</i></td>', 'hey I know this place!!   excellent idea - great angle!', '2006-07-13 23:31:02.000000', '2006-07-19 09:16:23.000000', 1),
(2620733, 361885, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very good.  A more refined crop make this even better in my opinion.  Undecided on the ''odd'' horizon/tilt, but does work as is.  Good sharp eye on the horse.</td>', '8 - Very good.  A more refined crop make this even better in my opinion.  Undecided on the ''odd'' horizon/tilt, but does work as is.  Good sharp eye on the horse.', '2006-07-13 23:44:44.000000', NULL, 1);
