(2621149, 359973, 60068, '<td valign="top">the centering of the cherry actually works really great here, I think mostly bc of the curve of the stem.  Think it''d be cool as a square with some of the empty sky cut out of the top</td>', 'the centering of the cherry actually works really great here, I think mostly bc of the curve of the stem.  Think it''d be cool as a square with some of the empty sky cut out of the top', '2006-07-14 01:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
