(2621519, 361742, 13759, '<td valign="top">Nice BW.really like the shades and tones. It seems to be a night shot due to the sky. I´m curious about how you catch it. Hope you have info to be viewed after challenge.</td>', 'Nice BW.really like the shades and tones. It seems to be a night shot due to the sky. I´m curious about how you catch it. Hope you have info to be viewed after challenge.', '2006-07-14 07:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2621521, 360420, 13759, '<td valign="top">Nice picture at all. It fits well in rythm patters of reflections too. The perspective part is a lot embeded with so many other relevent subjects that is dificult to see it. This continues to be a great picture, but only doesn´t the most pronouced perspective picture here.</td>', 'Nice picture at all. It fits well in rythm patters of reflections too. The perspective part is a lot embeded with so many other relevent subjects that is dificult to see it. This continues to be a great picture, but only doesn´t the most pronouced perspective picture here.', '2006-07-14 07:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2621523, 359917, 13759, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of subjects here. What is the subject with perspective? May be the Barn, as your title sugests, but it´s very flat to take account.</td>', 'There are a lot of subjects here. What is the subject with perspective? May be the Barn, as your title sugests, but it´s very flat to take account.', '2006-07-14 07:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2621526, 361671, 27482, '<td valign="top">OOhh, sorry but I strongly dislike the sky here, it just simply is extremely visually displeasing to me.  Only reason I am telling you this is I make it a rule of at least telling people why when I vote 3 or less and I gave this a 3.</td>', 'OOhh, sorry but I strongly dislike the sky here, it just simply is extremely visually displeasing to me.  Only reason I am telling you this is I make it a rule of at least telling people why when I vote 3 or less and I gave this a 3.', '2006-07-14 07:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2621527, 360433, 13759, '<td valign="top">Oh, nice turtle eyes! A had to confess, didn´t pay so much attention to turtles eyes. But talking of the challenge, sorry there are only a point of view (PoV) not a perspective here.</td>', 'Oh, nice turtle eyes! A had to confess, didn´t pay so much attention to turtles eyes. But talking of the challenge, sorry there are only a point of view (PoV) not a perspective here.', '2006-07-14 08:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2621528, 361865, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea or shot, just wish the black portions of the shot were not entirely pitch black, if I had edited this I would have applied a shadow/hliglight adjustment to ligthen up the dark areas of this photo.  Still nice and it got a 6 from me.</td>', 'Not a bad idea or shot, just wish the black portions of the shot were not entirely pitch black, if I had edited this I would have applied a shadow/hliglight adjustment to ligthen up the dark areas of this photo.  Still nice and it got a 6 from me.', '2006-07-14 08:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2621530, 362017, 13759, '<td valign="top">This is clearly a vanishing point shot! But is a nice perspective too due to de depth of subject.</td>', 'This is clearly a vanishing point shot! But is a nice perspective too due to de depth of subject.', '2006-07-14 08:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2621531, 360293, 13759, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I can´t find any perspective here, nor a point of view (a commom mistake in this challenge).</td>', 'Sorry, but I can´t find any perspective here, nor a point of view (a commom mistake in this challenge).', '2006-07-14 08:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
