(2621538, 360325, 13759, '<td valign="top">Unfortunatelly you don´t:<br/>- Shows the moon perspective (relationship of depth of a subject or representing a 3D subject in 2D).<br/>- Shows a new point of view of the moon (a misconcept very common in this challenge), like taking a picture from the moons surface or orbit.<br/> <br/>Then, I need to tell you: DNMC!</td>', 'Unfortunatelly you don´t:- Shows the moon perspective (relationship of depth of a subject or representing a 3D subject in 2D).- Shows a new point of view of the moon (a misconcept very common in this challenge), like taking a picture from the moons surface or orbit. Then, I need to tell you: DNMC!', '2006-07-14 08:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2621539, 361600, 13759, '<td valign="top">No perspective can be saw here.</td>', 'No perspective can be saw here.', '2006-07-14 08:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
