(2621551, 360831, 13759, '<td valign="top">Constrast is very high. There are a much few tones here (I can number them in my fingers) and worse that: I can´t see perspective clearly, here.</td>', 'Constrast is very high. There are a much few tones here (I can number them in my fingers) and worse that: I can´t see perspective clearly, here.', '2006-07-14 08:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2621555, 359148, 13759, '<td valign="top">Finally a picture withclear perspective. Congratulations!<br/>There are a few things to improve here, I think:<br/>1) noise. There are no need to get this subject wit so many noise, more light or a step of Noise Ninja or Neat Image will help a lot.<br/>2) DOF, using a wider angle and focusing at 1/3 of the image can make you get advantage of hyperfocal distance, improving a lot this kind of picture.</td>', 'Finally a picture withclear perspective. Congratulations!There are a few things to improve here, I think:1) noise. There are no need to get this subject wit so many noise, more light or a step of Noise Ninja or Neat Image will help a lot.2) DOF, using a wider angle and focusing at 1/3 of the image can make you get advantage of hyperfocal distance, improving a lot this kind of picture.', '2006-07-14 08:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2621556, 362306, 53293, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle, interesting idea ...</td>', 'Interesting angle, interesting idea ...', '2006-07-14 08:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2621558, 361643, 27482, '<td valign="top">I really dig the composition here and the little figure down there really adds to the shot, gives it a more monumental feel.  8 from me, nice work.</td>', 'I really dig the composition here and the little figure down there really adds to the shot, gives it a more monumental feel.  8 from me, nice work.', '2006-07-14 08:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2621560, 362485, 27482, '<td valign="top">I didn´t know ants use glasses :)</td>', 'I didn´t know ants use glasses :)', '2006-07-14 08:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
