(2621565, 360325, 27482, '<td valign="top">Really hard to rate this over 5, I mean, it´s not even in focus.  Had this shot been crystal clear and the moon filled up more of the frame I might have rated this pretty high but as it is, it got a 3 from me, mostly for image quality.  Not trying to offend, just make a rule of at least telling people why when I vote 3 or less.</td>', 'Really hard to rate this over 5, I mean, it´s not even in focus.  Had this shot been crystal clear and the moon filled up more of the frame I might have rated this pretty high but as it is, it got a 3 from me, mostly for image quality.  Not trying to offend, just make a rule of at least telling people why when I vote 3 or less.', '2006-07-14 08:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2621568, 360343, 27482, '<td valign="top">I might have rated this a 7 or an 8 if the image quality had been good, for me to like this it really needed to be tack sharp and crystal clear.  Still got a 6 from me as I realize it´s rediculously difficult to capture a fly in the air and freeze the motion.</td>', 'I might have rated this a 7 or an 8 if the image quality had been good, for me to like this it really needed to be tack sharp and crystal clear.  Still got a 6 from me as I realize it´s rediculously difficult to capture a fly in the air and freeze the motion.', '2006-07-14 08:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2621569, 362429, 13759, '<td valign="top">The DOF used here did not brings out the perspective used.</td>', 'The DOF used here did not brings out the perspective used.', '2006-07-14 08:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
