(2622539, 362214, 42100, '<td valign="top">The "look up the flag pole" photo is a bit overdone, but with the qualities of this one that can be quickly overlooked.  The color tones are very rich and vibrant, and the composition is very well balanced.  Very nice!</td>', 'The "look up the flag pole" photo is a bit overdone, but with the qualities of this one that can be quickly overlooked.  The color tones are very rich and vibrant, and the composition is very well balanced.  Very nice!', '2006-07-14 15:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2622550, 362078, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very busy and eclectic looking, but the composition with the leading lines and perspective make this work very beautifully.  Not to mention the very good B&amp;W tones.  Well done!</td>', 'Very busy and eclectic looking, but the composition with the leading lines and perspective make this work very beautifully.  Not to mention the very good B&W tones.  Well done!', '2006-07-14 15:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2622557, 361238, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great colors in this, very bright.  Good use of DOF in this macro.  The composition on this seems a bit static though.</td>', 'Great colors in this, very bright.  Good use of DOF in this macro.  The composition on this seems a bit static though.', '2006-07-14 15:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2622580, 359913, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great detail and lighting with this photo.  Very interesting with the DOF on the pieces.  Something about the composition though, seems too precise and doesn''t give the photo that extra oomph.  I know that doesn''t make much sense, but I just can''t think of a better way to explain it.</td>', 'Great detail and lighting with this photo.  Very interesting with the DOF on the pieces.  Something about the composition though, seems too precise and doesn''t give the photo that extra oomph.  I know that doesn''t make much sense, but I just can''t think of a better way to explain it.', '2006-07-14 15:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2622588, 359644, 37730, '<td valign="top">9 :)  how strange.  a photo you must take in perspective</td>', '9 :)  how strange.  a photo you must take in perspective', '2006-07-14 15:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
