(2625530, 362324, 43400, '<td valign="top">striking persp''ve and strong image--excellent in B&amp;W--well done.</td>', 'striking persp''ve and strong image--excellent in B&W--well done.', '2006-07-15 21:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625532, 359625, 43400, '<td valign="top">i''m expecting them become animated--interesting capture</td>', 'i''m expecting them become animated--interesting capture', '2006-07-15 21:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625533, 359644, 62187, '<td valign="top">That''s just strange...</td>', 'That''s just strange...', '2006-07-15 21:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625541, 361189, 43400, '<td valign="top">interesting subject and capture, though it''s more of an isometric than a perspective angle because the bottle''s vertical lines are close to being parallel rather than converging--i think a wider angled lense would fix that. good potential.</td>', 'interesting subject and capture, though it''s more of an isometric than a perspective angle because the bottle''s vertical lines are close to being parallel rather than converging--i think a wider angled lense would fix that. good potential.', '2006-07-15 21:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625553, 359984, 43400, '<td valign="top">interesting, but unfortunately not convincing to be a perspective--i''m trying to understanding how this was done. good colors and tonal quality</td>', 'interesting, but unfortunately not convincing to be a perspective--i''m trying to understanding how this was done. good colors and tonal quality', '2006-07-15 21:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625555, 361974, 56826, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2006-07-15 21:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625592, 361315, 24454, '<td valign="top">BEAUTIFUL!!!!</td>', 'BEAUTIFUL!!!!', '2006-07-15 22:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625610, 361079, 24454, '<td valign="top">This really is amazing.   I''m thinking that it''s upside down because the reflection in the water is brighter and sharper than the image on top.    But it''s amazing that you can''t tell. . .and I could be wrong.<br/> <br/>It is very beautiful.   I love it!  9</td>', 'This really is amazing.   I''m thinking that it''s upside down because the reflection in the water is brighter and sharper than the image on top.    But it''s amazing that you can''t tell. . .and I could be wrong. It is very beautiful.   I love it!  9', '2006-07-15 22:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625615, 362336, 24454, '<td valign="top">I really love this photo.   I wish it was a little more in focus, but the perspective is just so good. ..and I love these "in-your-face" close cropped photos.    And I do notice there''s a very crystal clear sharp teeny tiny lady bug too :)   8</td>', 'I really love this photo.   I wish it was a little more in focus, but the perspective is just so good. ..and I love these "in-your-face" close cropped photos.    And I do notice there''s a very crystal clear sharp teeny tiny lady bug too :)   8', '2006-07-15 22:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625620, 361865, 24454, '<td valign="top">HOW awesome!!   It''s very dark on my monitor on the left, but I don''t need the left to love the photo.   I love the lighting on the water and edge of the beach, and I love the perspective the little person gives.  This is great!!</td>', 'HOW awesome!!   It''s very dark on my monitor on the left, but I don''t need the left to love the photo.   I love the lighting on the water and edge of the beach, and I love the perspective the little person gives.  This is great!!', '2006-07-15 22:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625626, 362501, 24454, '<td valign="top">Yes she is!!!!!!!   (just too cute)  I want to eat her up :)</td>', 'Yes she is!!!!!!!   (just too cute)  I want to eat her up :)', '2006-07-15 22:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625633, 359580, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh I love photos like this.   What a MAJESTIC sky!!   Wow!</td>', 'Oh I love photos like this.   What a MAJESTIC sky!!   Wow!', '2006-07-15 22:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625636, 360252, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!   This is an amazing perspective photo.   How did you do it?    One of my favorites for this challenge!</td>', 'Wow!   This is an amazing perspective photo.   How did you do it?    One of my favorites for this challenge!', '2006-07-15 22:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625640, 361603, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwwww. . .how could you not give a cute little face like that a high score!!!    How CUTE Floyd is!   I love it.</td>', 'Awwwww. . .how could you not give a cute little face like that a high score!!!    How CUTE Floyd is!   I love it.', '2006-07-15 22:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625642, 361929, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is so awesome!  I love the way it''s composed.   I love the silhouette, and of course. . .those colors are spectacular!   It''s pretty close to perfect. . .close enough for me to be happy to give it a 10.</td>', 'This is so awesome!  I love the way it''s composed.   I love the silhouette, and of course. . .those colors are spectacular!   It''s pretty close to perfect. . .close enough for me to be happy to give it a 10.', '2006-07-15 22:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625645, 361238, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very awesome!   I love the splashes of that hot pink.  It looks like hot pink light!   Can''t see any flaws with it whatsoever!  10</td>', 'Very awesome!   I love the splashes of that hot pink.  It looks like hot pink light!   Can''t see any flaws with it whatsoever!  10', '2006-07-15 22:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625646, 362117, 43031, '<td valign="top">This image creeps me out for some reason. I think the angle makes you feel like you''re going to fall in. Making your photo edgy is good, but I think this goes overboard and causes a negative mental knee-jerk reaction in many viewers. Especially those with a slight fear of heights, like me.</td>', 'This image creeps me out for some reason. I think the angle makes you feel like you''re going to fall in. Making your photo edgy is good, but I think this goes overboard and causes a negative mental knee-jerk reaction in many viewers. Especially those with a slight fear of heights, like me.', '2006-07-15 22:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625657, 362285, 43031, '<td valign="top">This photo looks a bit blurry to me here, I''m not quite sure, but I think your camera focused o the central tower, which looks fairly sharp, but the other towers and the grass look out of focus. I think what was needed here (based on these conclusions, which could be wrong) is a hihger f/ number to bring a deeper overall depth of field. This also may have meant shoting on a  tripod, as it would affect your shutter speed.overall good composition of elements, everything just needs to be in sharp focus here.</td>', 'This photo looks a bit blurry to me here, I''m not quite sure, but I think your camera focused o the central tower, which looks fairly sharp, but the other towers and the grass look out of focus. I think what was needed here (based on these conclusions, which could be wrong) is a hihger f/ number to bring a deeper overall depth of field. This also may have meant shoting on a  tripod, as it would affect your shutter speed.overall good composition of elements, everything just needs to be in sharp focus here.', '2006-07-15 22:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625660, 362033, 43400, '<td valign="top">nice structure and lighting--i would have taken it a step further and explore various angles other than eye level in center of space, i.e. shot from the floor or close to it off-angle---very good capture though.</td>', 'nice structure and lighting--i would have taken it a step further and explore various angles other than eye level in center of space, i.e. shot from the floor or close to it off-angle---very good capture though.', '2006-07-15 22:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625662, 361944, 43400, '<td valign="top">just a bit dark and noisy--but good potential</td>', 'just a bit dark and noisy--but good potential', '2006-07-15 22:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625674, 361791, 43400, '<td valign="top">fantastic detail and color tones, but the angle is a bit much--i like the subject though.</td>', 'fantastic detail and color tones, but the angle is a bit much--i like the subject though.', '2006-07-15 22:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625721, 362382, 47704, '<td valign="top">sized incorrectly.</td>', 'sized incorrectly.', '2006-07-15 23:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625751, 361654, 61046, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how you did this shot, but it is very nicely done.</td>', 'I''m not sure how you did this shot, but it is very nicely done.', '2006-07-15 23:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625799, 362256, 47852, '<td valign="top">Great vivid colors, and I like the perpendicular trails of cloud in the sky.</td>', 'Great vivid colors, and I like the perpendicular trails of cloud in the sky.', '2006-07-15 23:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625801, 361527, 47852, '<td valign="top">I''m going to just tell myself that you set a pair of shoes up there on the edge to help with the fear of heights... very convincing perspective!  Also like the symmetry of the yellow lines leading in.  Well composed.</td>', 'I''m going to just tell myself that you set a pair of shoes up there on the edge to help with the fear of heights... very convincing perspective!  Also like the symmetry of the yellow lines leading in.  Well composed.', '2006-07-15 23:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625802, 362456, 43774, '<td valign="top">Great job, creative as always!!</td>', 'Great job, creative as always!!', '2006-07-15 23:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625803, 362437, 43774, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites, awesome sky.</td>', 'One of my favourites, awesome sky.', '2006-07-15 23:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625806, 362529, 47852, '<td valign="top">Ohhh, one of those groaner titles!  Can''t quite figure out what the background is, but it''s neat how it picks up the colors in the flies.</td>', 'Ohhh, one of those groaner titles!  Can''t quite figure out what the background is, but it''s neat how it picks up the colors in the flies.', '2006-07-15 23:57:21.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2625807, 361754, 20530, '<td valign="top">Great find! Love the primary colors and the rythm created by repeption. Oh, and good perspective, too.</td>', 'Great find! Love the primary colors and the rythm created by repeption. Oh, and good perspective, too.', '2006-07-15 23:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625808, 362338, 20530, '<td valign="top">Good use of diagonal composition.</td>', 'Good use of diagonal composition.', '2006-07-15 23:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625819, 362190, 20530, '<td valign="top">That''s unique and creative. Nice focus and interesting lighting. Compositionally, the crop of the bottle lip is a detractor, IMHO. Lot''s of potential for this image. Brings back memories of watching someone pick up one of these and take a swig.</td>', 'That''s unique and creative. Nice focus and interesting lighting. Compositionally, the crop of the bottle lip is a detractor, IMHO. Lot''s of potential for this image. Brings back memories of watching someone pick up one of these and take a swig.', '2006-07-16 00:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625824, 361015, 20530, '<td valign="top">I really like this one. The color is very cool and the great perspective is perfectly accentuated by the people.</td>', 'I really like this one. The color is very cool and the great perspective is perfectly accentuated by the people.', '2006-07-16 00:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625829, 361755, 17148, '<td valign="top">This photo looks a tad soft...like the focus is a bit off...or maybe you went for that effect with neat image or something...also would make the shot a bit better if the light on both...actresses...was the same...looks like one is in a shadow. Nice shot for what you were going for.</td>', 'This photo looks a tad soft...like the focus is a bit off...or maybe you went for that effect with neat image or something...also would make the shot a bit better if the light on both...actresses...was the same...looks like one is in a shadow. Nice shot for what you were going for.', '2006-07-16 00:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625834, 362115, 17148, '<td valign="top">Little bit dark around the eye...maybe if you did a flash it would help...but if you were using a telephoto it might not help out that much and also might cause the guy to stampede.</td>', 'Little bit dark around the eye...maybe if you did a flash it would help...but if you were using a telephoto it might not help out that much and also might cause the guy to stampede.', '2006-07-16 00:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625836, 362200, 20530, '<td valign="top">I like this. Good perspective with the boaters in different areas. I also think that a diagonal shot of just the boats would make a really cool image. Great colors.</td>', 'I like this. Good perspective with the boaters in different areas. I also think that a diagonal shot of just the boats would make a really cool image. Great colors.', '2006-07-16 00:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625843, 362238, 37334, '<td valign="top">Great lighting.</td>', 'Great lighting.', '2006-07-16 00:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625848, 359982, 37334, '<td valign="top">I like the way the road leads you through the image. That white corner is a little distracting though, and pulls the eye towards it, and keeps it there.</td>', 'I like the way the road leads you through the image. That white corner is a little distracting though, and pulls the eye towards it, and keeps it there.', '2006-07-16 00:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625874, 361643, 37334, '<td valign="top">The person at the bottom adds a sense of scale. Nice shot.</td>', 'The person at the bottom adds a sense of scale. Nice shot.', '2006-07-16 00:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625906, 361974, 43031, '<td valign="top">simply breathtaking. no more words needed.</td>', 'simply breathtaking. no more words needed.', '2006-07-16 00:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625909, 361754, 43031, '<td valign="top">wonderful leading swoosh in this diagonal, provides wonderful interest, and the colors are just absolutely stunning. best of luck in this, 10</td>', 'wonderful leading swoosh in this diagonal, provides wonderful interest, and the colors are just absolutely stunning. best of luck in this, 10', '2006-07-16 00:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625910, 362078, 43031, '<td valign="top">perspective, in all the senses of the word I think. wonderful and skillful black and white image, wonderful dof, and great leading lines.</td>', 'perspective, in all the senses of the word I think. wonderful and skillful black and white image, wonderful dof, and great leading lines.', '2006-07-16 00:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625912, 360889, 43031, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning image and depth of field. shows a real control of the lens with nice negative space, and wonderfully sharp subject. Lines on the lizards back lead nicely from the darkness to the head, which is given even greater impact by the DOF. 10</td>', 'Absolutely stunning image and depth of field. shows a real control of the lens with nice negative space, and wonderfully sharp subject. Lines on the lizards back lead nicely from the darkness to the head, which is given even greater impact by the DOF. 10', '2006-07-16 00:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625925, 360749, 37334, '<td valign="top">So much to look at! The eye is nicely led in to the image by the road, where our focus moves to those lovely mountains, and then onto that castle. The lighting is nice and subdued, and a good use of the rule of thirds.<br/>I do though feel as if the image is falling off the the right a little..I think it needs a little rotation to straighten it a little? A great image though. 8</td>', 'So much to look at! The eye is nicely led in to the image by the road, where our focus moves to those lovely mountains, and then onto that castle. The lighting is nice and subdued, and a good use of the rule of thirds.I do though feel as if the image is falling off the the right a little..I think it needs a little rotation to straighten it a little? A great image though. 8', '2006-07-16 00:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2625993, 362539, 61030, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit crooked.</td>', 'It''s a bit crooked.', '2006-07-16 01:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626001, 362502, 61030, '<td valign="top">Too many dust spots on the photo.</td>', 'Too many dust spots on the photo.', '2006-07-16 01:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626039, 361571, 50695, '<td valign="top">that box of tissues makes the whole picture for me.</td>', 'that box of tissues makes the whole picture for me.', '2006-07-16 02:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626052, 360955, 59343, '<td valign="top">This definitely fits the challnge for perspective but the colors are a bit flat.</td>', 'This definitely fits the challnge for perspective but the colors are a bit flat.', '2006-07-16 02:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626054, 362539, 59343, '<td valign="top">I like how the sun can be seen through the arches.  Interesting effect.</td>', 'I like how the sun can be seen through the arches.  Interesting effect.', '2006-07-16 02:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626057, 362465, 59343, '<td valign="top">The sky seems a bit flat and the picture seems a bit oversharpened otherwise.  Nice composition though.  I like the water in the foreground.</td>', 'The sky seems a bit flat and the picture seems a bit oversharpened otherwise.  Nice composition though.  I like the water in the foreground.', '2006-07-16 02:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
