(2626319, 362380, 52130, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if I like the angle this was taken at. I don''t know where you are from (I''m guessing N.Y.), but in US culture, people usually aesthetically<br/>like images going from left to right (since that is the way we read). Maybe try switching it and see if it looks better. Other than that, it''s very dominating and poweful.</td>', 'I don''t know if I like the angle this was taken at. I don''t know where you are from (I''m guessing N.Y.), but in US culture, people usually aestheticallylike images going from left to right (since that is the way we read). Maybe try switching it and see if it looks better. Other than that, it''s very dominating and poweful.', '2006-07-16 06:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
