(2626599, 361948, 40323, '<td valign="top">I see where you were going with this but the building is underexposed and a bit out of focus.  The composition could also be more exciting.  You could increase the dramatic effect if you included more of the top of the building so you can see how far it stretches away from the camera and put the building at more of an angle in the composition.</td>', 'I see where you were going with this but the building is underexposed and a bit out of focus.  The composition could also be more exciting.  You could increase the dramatic effect if you included more of the top of the building so you can see how far it stretches away from the camera and put the building at more of an angle in the composition.', '2006-07-16 11:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
