(2626676, 362250, 60862, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the attempt, but to me, those items are so clearly different in size that it ends up looking like an off-center shot of the ship, with the mountains simply as background.  To catch my eye, the two things you''re comparing visually have to appear to be at the same distance and reasonably close in size.</td>', 'I appreciate the attempt, but to me, those items are so clearly different in size that it ends up looking like an off-center shot of the ship, with the mountains simply as background.  To catch my eye, the two things you''re comparing visually have to appear to be at the same distance and reasonably close in size.', '2006-07-16 12:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626677, 361071, 60862, '<td valign="top">Not lit well and blurry.</td>', 'Not lit well and blurry.', '2006-07-16 12:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626678, 360768, 60862, '<td valign="top">The highlights are blown out, and I''m not getting the hidden perspective.</td>', 'The highlights are blown out, and I''m not getting the hidden perspective.', '2006-07-16 12:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626679, 359644, 60862, '<td valign="top">Ha!</td>', 'Ha!', '2006-07-16 12:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626681, 360930, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice angle.  It would be nice if the bottom of the flower were better lit, though.</td>', 'Nice angle.  It would be nice if the bottom of the flower were better lit, though.', '2006-07-16 12:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626684, 362211, 60862, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle.  Minor points: her head seems a little crammed into the corner and the lighting seems a little bright.</td>', 'Interesting angle.  Minor points: her head seems a little crammed into the corner and the lighting seems a little bright.', '2006-07-16 12:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626687, 359918, 60862, '<td valign="top">The bricks provide nice perspective lines, but they don''t really carry far enough into the picture.  Might work better further down the wall so more bricks are visible.<br/> <br/>Also, it''s tough to get the lighting right shooting into that lamp.</td>', 'The bricks provide nice perspective lines, but they don''t really carry far enough into the picture.  Might work better further down the wall so more bricks are visible. Also, it''s tough to get the lighting right shooting into that lamp.', '2006-07-16 12:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626690, 361930, 60862, '<td valign="top">A beautiful picture, but I''m not getting the visual meaning of "perspective" since the bridge is nearly all at the same distance, and the other details are too dim to convey something receding.</td>', 'A beautiful picture, but I''m not getting the visual meaning of "perspective" since the bridge is nearly all at the same distance, and the other details are too dim to convey something receding.', '2006-07-16 12:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626692, 359240, 60862, '<td valign="top">Sorry, nice pic, but doesn''t convey "perspective" to me in any sense.<br/> <br/>Now, the same kid, but far to the left in a horizontal shot with a lot of water on the right, and I''d get the title.</td>', 'Sorry, nice pic, but doesn''t convey "perspective" to me in any sense. Now, the same kid, but far to the left in a horizontal shot with a lot of water on the right, and I''d get the title.', '2006-07-16 12:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626693, 359558, 60862, '<td valign="top">Everything''s crossing the frame horizontally, so I''m not getting a sense of perspective.</td>', 'Everything''s crossing the frame horizontally, so I''m not getting a sense of perspective.', '2006-07-16 12:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626694, 362311, 60862, '<td valign="top">Perspective?</td>', 'Perspective?', '2006-07-16 12:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626695, 361845, 60862, '<td valign="top">Would have convey perspective better from closer to dead-on to the nose, with the rest of the plane receding.  This looks like just a normal shot of the plane.</td>', 'Would have convey perspective better from closer to dead-on to the nose, with the rest of the plane receding.  This looks like just a normal shot of the plane.', '2006-07-16 12:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626696, 361743, 60862, '<td valign="top">I think the shallow DOF hurt this.  It looks like a picture of a float, as opposed to a picture of a line of floats receding into the distance.</td>', 'I think the shallow DOF hurt this.  It looks like a picture of a float, as opposed to a picture of a line of floats receding into the distance.', '2006-07-16 12:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626697, 360772, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but it would''ve worked better to put the final lamp on the right closer to the middle instead of the closest one.</td>', 'I like the concept, but it would''ve worked better to put the final lamp on the right closer to the middle instead of the closest one.', '2006-07-16 12:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626699, 361400, 60862, '<td valign="top">Fun pic!  I just took some similar ones of my daughter.  But I don''t see this fitting in "perspective."</td>', 'Fun pic!  I just took some similar ones of my daughter.  But I don''t see this fitting in "perspective."', '2006-07-16 12:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626702, 362538, 60862, '<td valign="top">I see the perspective of the lines.  I would''ve preferred it in better focus and more contrast.<br/> <br/>I don''t understand the title.  I thought this was a guitar.</td>', 'I see the perspective of the lines.  I would''ve preferred it in better focus and more contrast. I don''t understand the title.  I thought this was a guitar.', '2006-07-16 12:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626703, 362523, 60862, '<td valign="top">I think you cropped this too tight, and the angle''s too high.  It comes across as an abstract, so the sense of receding into the distance gets lost.</td>', 'I think you cropped this too tight, and the angle''s too high.  It comes across as an abstract, so the sense of receding into the distance gets lost.', '2006-07-16 12:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626706, 362082, 60862, '<td valign="top">Cool!  More contrast might make it more of a "wow" shot.</td>', 'Cool!  More contrast might make it more of a "wow" shot.', '2006-07-16 12:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626708, 362158, 60862, '<td valign="top">The angle and cropping remove all sense of distance, so the perspective is lost.</td>', 'The angle and cropping remove all sense of distance, so the perspective is lost.', '2006-07-16 12:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626709, 361238, 60862, '<td valign="top">The DOF is a little too shallow.  It ends up focusing all of my attention on the head, while the entire body fades into the background.<br/> <br/>It doesn''t "recede" into the background, but rather becomes part of the flat background, so perspective disappears.<br/> <br/>That said, simply as a random picture, I''d love to see this cropped tightly to the head and brightened up a bit.  It looks like you captured very nice details on the head.</td>', 'The DOF is a little too shallow.  It ends up focusing all of my attention on the head, while the entire body fades into the background. It doesn''t "recede" into the background, but rather becomes part of the flat background, so perspective disappears. That said, simply as a random picture, I''d love to see this cropped tightly to the head and brightened up a bit.  It looks like you captured very nice details on the head.', '2006-07-16 12:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626710, 359917, 60862, '<td valign="top">Not really much perpective in this shot, although it''s a nice picture of the barn.</td>', 'Not really much perpective in this shot, although it''s a nice picture of the barn.', '2006-07-16 12:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626711, 360648, 60862, '<td valign="top">Interesting take and way of showing perspective!</td>', 'Interesting take and way of showing perspective!', '2006-07-16 12:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626713, 362306, 60862, '<td valign="top">Interesting way to use a closeup to show perspective!</td>', 'Interesting way to use a closeup to show perspective!', '2006-07-16 12:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626714, 362200, 60862, '<td valign="top">I can''t decide whether the focus is on the boats or the shoreline.  If it''s the boats, a lower angle would''ve conveyed perspective better.  The shoreline''s a little too far away and becomes visually flat at tjavascript: do_vote(5)<br/> 5 his angle.</td>', 'I can''t decide whether the focus is on the boats or the shoreline.  If it''s the boats, a lower angle would''ve conveyed perspective better.  The shoreline''s a little too far away and becomes visually flat at tjavascript: do_vote(5) 5 his angle.', '2006-07-16 12:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626716, 361043, 32293, '<td valign="top">hmmm, looks more like wheat to me :-)<br/>Nice perspective and bold background</td>', 'hmmm, looks more like wheat to me :-)Nice perspective and bold background', '2006-07-16 12:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626717, 361554, 60862, '<td valign="top">Too dark and blurry, and the black thing on the right is distracting.</td>', 'Too dark and blurry, and the black thing on the right is distracting.', '2006-07-16 12:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626719, 362454, 60862, '<td valign="top">Too dark and too low contrast.  The shape''s great, and if it were brightly lit against the dark sky, or dark against a bright sky, it''d be much better.  probably bright against dark would be best, to capture the lines going up the tower, which enhance the perspective effect.<br/> <br/>This is one where I''d love to see some post-processing and another version of it in your portfolio.</td>', 'Too dark and too low contrast.  The shape''s great, and if it were brightly lit against the dark sky, or dark against a bright sky, it''d be much better.  probably bright against dark would be best, to capture the lines going up the tower, which enhance the perspective effect. This is one where I''d love to see some post-processing and another version of it in your portfolio.', '2006-07-16 12:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626720, 362541, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice leading lines on both sides.</td>', 'Nice leading lines on both sides.', '2006-07-16 12:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626721, 362384, 60862, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset, but not really showing perspective.</td>', 'Beautiful sunset, but not really showing perspective.', '2006-07-16 12:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626725, 362439, 60862, '<td valign="top">Don''t see the perspective.  And it''s pretty dark.  Maybe a different angle?  The line between sea and beach might provide perspective closer to the water, angled more, and as a landscape vs. portrait shot.</td>', 'Don''t see the perspective.  And it''s pretty dark.  Maybe a different angle?  The line between sea and beach might provide perspective closer to the water, angled more, and as a landscape vs. portrait shot.', '2006-07-16 12:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626727, 362048, 60862, '<td valign="top">Without the title, this is just a picture of a flower from below.<br/> <br/>Is there some way you get something larger to show up under the flower, like a kid, bike, etc.?</td>', 'Without the title, this is just a picture of a flower from below. Is there some way you get something larger to show up under the flower, like a kid, bike, etc.?', '2006-07-16 12:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626729, 360955, 60862, '<td valign="top">Leak?  Huh?<br/> <br/>Classic view of perspective, but the curve adds a nice touch.  The DOF is a little too shallow for me.</td>', 'Leak?  Huh? Classic view of perspective, but the curve adds a nice touch.  The DOF is a little too shallow for me.', '2006-07-16 12:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626732, 359350, 60862, '<td valign="top">Interesting framing to show perspective.  But according to the title, the white structure seen through the frame is the subject, so this shot is too wide.  Cropped tighter might look better.  Not so tight you lose the sense of distance, though.</td>', 'Interesting framing to show perspective.  But according to the title, the white structure seen through the frame is the subject, so this shot is too wide.  Cropped tighter might look better.  Not so tight you lose the sense of distance, though.', '2006-07-16 12:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626734, 362502, 60862, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Unlike many shots, you captured both perspective and beauty in one picture.<br/> <br/>It''s a shame about the hair on the left and the spot on the right, but since it''s basic editing, it doesn''t affect my score.  It also looks like you might have compressed it a bit far or converted to GIF at some point, because the sky shouldn''t have those bands.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Unlike many shots, you captured both perspective and beauty in one picture. It''s a shame about the hair on the left and the spot on the right, but since it''s basic editing, it doesn''t affect my score.  It also looks like you might have compressed it a bit far or converted to GIF at some point, because the sky shouldn''t have those bands.', '2006-07-16 12:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626735, 360173, 60862, '<td valign="top">Perspective?  Lost.</td>', 'Perspective?  Lost.', '2006-07-16 12:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626736, 362533, 60862, '<td valign="top">Pretty!</td>', 'Pretty!', '2006-07-16 12:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626739, 359709, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I would''ve like it better in razor-sharp focus.</td>', 'Nice idea.  I would''ve like it better in razor-sharp focus.', '2006-07-16 12:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626743, 360252, 60862, '<td valign="top">Good idea.</td>', 'Good idea.', '2006-07-16 12:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626746, 362530, 60862, '<td valign="top">I get your point here, but the cars are soooo out of focus that they become just a blurry background.  Try it with more DOF.  Of course, then you run into having too busy a background.  You might want to try it again with just one car.</td>', 'I get your point here, but the cars are soooo out of focus that they become just a blurry background.  Try it with more DOF.  Of course, then you run into having too busy a background.  You might want to try it again with just one car.', '2006-07-16 12:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626747, 362144, 60862, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea, and I''ve tried it myself.  But it just comes out as a blurry photo.</td>', 'Not a bad idea, and I''ve tried it myself.  But it just comes out as a blurry photo.', '2006-07-16 12:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626750, 361380, 60862, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t convey perspective to me.</td>', 'This doesn''t convey perspective to me.', '2006-07-16 12:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
