(2626758, 361735, 60862, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really fit the topic of perspective.  Cool shot, though!</td>', 'Doesn''t really fit the topic of perspective.  Cool shot, though!', '2006-07-16 12:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626760, 361983, 60862, '<td valign="top">Not getting the subject "perspective" although it''s a nice silhouette.</td>', 'Not getting the subject "perspective" although it''s a nice silhouette.', '2006-07-16 12:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626762, 362438, 60862, '<td valign="top">Because it''s so dead-center, I see the inner circle as being at the same distance as the outer one.  Try it at a slight angle to show the net receding from the camera.</td>', 'Because it''s so dead-center, I see the inner circle as being at the same distance as the outer one.  Try it at a slight angle to show the net receding from the camera.', '2006-07-16 12:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626763, 362159, 60862, '<td valign="top">Funny take!</td>', 'Funny take!', '2006-07-16 12:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626764, 361622, 60862, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Even after your eye follows the lines to the ship, the ship itself carries you further into the distance.</td>', 'Very nice!  Even after your eye follows the lines to the ship, the ship itself carries you further into the distance.', '2006-07-16 12:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626766, 362268, 60862, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, but doesn''t convey "perspective" to me.</td>', 'Wonderful shot, but doesn''t convey "perspective" to me.', '2006-07-16 12:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626768, 362385, 60862, '<td valign="top">Too shallow DOF.   Everything in the background appears to be flat, at the same distance.<br/> <br/>I think you wanted to show the clothesline receding from the camera, but this doesn''t convey that to me.</td>', 'Too shallow DOF.   Everything in the background appears to be flat, at the same distance. I think you wanted to show the clothesline receding from the camera, but this doesn''t convey that to me.', '2006-07-16 12:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626769, 362258, 60862, '<td valign="top">Because of the crop, I don''t get the feeling of the keyboard receding from the camera.  It would''ve worked better to include the full length, with the hands at the far end.<br/> <br/>It''s a nice photo, but doesn''t convey "perspective" especially strongly.</td>', 'Because of the crop, I don''t get the feeling of the keyboard receding from the camera.  It would''ve worked better to include the full length, with the hands at the far end. It''s a nice photo, but doesn''t convey "perspective" especially strongly.', '2006-07-16 12:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626770, 362081, 40323, '<td valign="top">I hope he/she''s ok.</td>', 'I hope he/she''s ok.', '2006-07-16 12:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626771, 360889, 40323, '<td valign="top">Love the DOF, composition and details.  Great shot.</td>', 'Love the DOF, composition and details.  Great shot.', '2006-07-16 12:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626772, 360991, 60862, '<td valign="top">From your title, you meant the DOF.  Fine.  But the extremely shallow DOF destroys some of the perspective.  The pipes then become part of a flat background instead of drawing the eye deeper into the distance.</td>', 'From your title, you meant the DOF.  Fine.  But the extremely shallow DOF destroys some of the perspective.  The pipes then become part of a flat background instead of drawing the eye deeper into the distance.', '2006-07-16 12:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626774, 361135, 60862, '<td valign="top">Interesting and different interpretation of "perspective."  And, indeed, this is a view we never really get in normal life.</td>', 'Interesting and different interpretation of "perspective."  And, indeed, this is a view we never really get in normal life.', '2006-07-16 12:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2626775, 359590, 60862, '<td valign="top">How does this fit the theme of perspective?</td>', 'How does this fit the theme of perspective?', '2006-07-16 12:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
