(2627005, 361684, 60862, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what that is, and it''s blurry and dark, so I don''t get either a sense of being drawn into the distance.  Neither do I get "a different angle" on something.</td>', 'Don''t know what that is, and it''s blurry and dark, so I don''t get either a sense of being drawn into the distance.  Neither do I get "a different angle" on something.', '2006-07-16 14:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
