(2627008, 361587, 60862, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, if a little dark in the foreground.  But I don''t get a sense of being pulled into the distance.</td>', 'Beautiful, if a little dark in the foreground.  But I don''t get a sense of being pulled into the distance.', '2006-07-16 14:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2627010, 362444, 60862, '<td valign="top">The nearly horizontal lines tend to stop my eye from going deeper into the distance.  That is, the much larger number of horizontals vs. verticals.</td>', 'The nearly horizontal lines tend to stop my eye from going deeper into the distance.  That is, the much larger number of horizontals vs. verticals.', '2006-07-16 14:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
