(2627013, 361366, 60862, '<td valign="top">The boat''s tip is effective, so I''ll give this a 5.  If the angle had been lower, so the tip was higher in the photo, it would''ve been higher.</td>', 'The boat''s tip is effective, so I''ll give this a 5.  If the angle had been lower, so the tip was higher in the photo, it would''ve been higher.', '2006-07-16 14:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
