(2627022, 360373, 60862, '<td valign="top">This shows some perspective, but the angle, lighting, and subject aren''t very interesting.  I think the plants are distracting me from the texture and lines among the stones.</td>', 'This shows some perspective, but the angle, lighting, and subject aren''t very interesting.  I think the plants are distracting me from the texture and lines among the stones.', '2006-07-16 14:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2627024, 362505, 60862, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but only two lines don''t show much perspective.  And the pictures'' blurry.</td>', 'Sorry, but only two lines don''t show much perspective.  And the pictures'' blurry.', '2006-07-16 14:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2627025, 360782, 60862, '<td valign="top">Simply shooting a macro doesn''t convey much.  And I''ve seen this angle on a hard drive too many times for it to be a new look at something.<br/> <br/>That said, it''s a nice photo.</td>', 'Simply shooting a macro doesn''t convey much.  And I''ve seen this angle on a hard drive too many times for it to be a new look at something. That said, it''s a nice photo.', '2006-07-16 14:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2627028, 360586, 60862, '<td valign="top">So mysterious.  Makes me want to walk down there to see what''s in the dark.</td>', 'So mysterious.  Makes me want to walk down there to see what''s in the dark.', '2006-07-16 14:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2627030, 360005, 60862, '<td valign="top">Wouldn''t it be cool if they built curvy columns?</td>', 'Wouldn''t it be cool if they built curvy columns?', '2006-07-16 14:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
