(2627211, 361482, 59343, '<td valign="top">I definitely think this is an interesting perspective.  I like the texture in the railing.  I think the colors a bit flat though.  I also don''t think that the grass and tree to the right of the railing really offer that much to the photo.</td>', 'I definitely think this is an interesting perspective.  I like the texture in the railing.  I think the colors a bit flat though.  I also don''t think that the grass and tree to the right of the railing really offer that much to the photo.', '2006-07-16 15:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2627215, 361587, 59343, '<td valign="top">nice picture of the mountains.  Is there any way you could have lightened the foreground--or taken this at a time of day with a bit more even light between the mountains and foreground--or used an ND filter (graduated).</td>', 'nice picture of the mountains.  Is there any way you could have lightened the foreground--or taken this at a time of day with a bit more even light between the mountains and foreground--or used an ND filter (graduated).', '2006-07-16 15:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
