(2627346, 362380, 60862, '<td valign="top">Oversharpened, or at least it has that kind of halo.  But great angle.  I wonder why it needed to be validated.  Looks like a perfectly normal shot.</td>', 'Oversharpened, or at least it has that kind of halo.  But great angle.  I wonder why it needed to be validated.  Looks like a perfectly normal shot.', '2006-07-16 17:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
