(2628594, 362238, 37893, '<td valign="top">Clean lines and a convincing POV makes this image pop right off the page. The little shrub of leaves on the left bothers me a bit but the leading lines are stunning. The sky is processed really well without going overboard. Good luck.</td>', 'Clean lines and a convincing POV makes this image pop right off the page. The little shrub of leaves on the left bothers me a bit but the leading lines are stunning. The sky is processed really well without going overboard. Good luck.', '2006-07-17 02:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
