(2628681, 361208, 30861, '<td valign="top">oh wow... this is done on BASIC? It''s an extraordinary rendering... I''m not sure how well it addresses the challenge, but I use an "on/off" switch for meeting the challenge, and I''m letting this one in on the plus side: so good luck with it! And if you know my work, you know I''m a connoisseur of stark sunrise/sunset images like this :-)</td>', 'oh wow... this is done on BASIC? It''s an extraordinary rendering... I''m not sure how well it addresses the challenge, but I use an "on/off" switch for meeting the challenge, and I''m letting this one in on the plus side: so good luck with it! And if you know my work, you know I''m a connoisseur of stark sunrise/sunset images like this :-)', '2006-07-17 02:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2628690, 361754, 30861, '<td valign="top">Nice! Love the intricate-yet-subtle composition of this!</td>', 'Nice! Love the intricate-yet-subtle composition of this!', '2006-07-17 02:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2628693, 362502, 30861, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, potentially, but devastatingly bad processing artifacts. If you''re interested, feel free to communicate with me on how to post-process this image without artifacts :-)</td>', 'Lovely image, potentially, but devastatingly bad processing artifacts. If you''re interested, feel free to communicate with me on how to post-process this image without artifacts :-)', '2006-07-17 02:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2628953, 362247, 57229, '<td valign="top">Poseidon, pity about the spelling (dnmc because of misplaced letter in title).<br/>Good dramatic effect.</td>', 'Poseidon, pity about the spelling (dnmc because of misplaced letter in title).Good dramatic effect.', '2006-07-17 05:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2629041, 362319, 35602, '<td valign="top">Wow, awesome shot.  Love it completely.  10</td>', 'Wow, awesome shot.  Love it completely.  10', '2006-07-17 07:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2629042, 362525, 35602, '<td valign="top">Definitely art.  Very nice use of linear composition.</td>', 'Definitely art.  Very nice use of linear composition.', '2006-07-17 07:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2629044, 361527, 35602, '<td valign="top">Suicide is painless.  Anyway, I like the repeat of the arched pattern in the stitching of the slippers and the arch on the sidewalk.  You noted that particular detail and used it to your advantage.  The photo seems a bit flat, though.  Maybe the light was overcast or something, but you don''t get the sense of height that you were trying to convey in the image.  Still, I give it a 7</td>', 'Suicide is painless.  Anyway, I like the repeat of the arched pattern in the stitching of the slippers and the arch on the sidewalk.  You noted that particular detail and used it to your advantage.  The photo seems a bit flat, though.  Maybe the light was overcast or something, but you don''t get the sense of height that you were trying to convey in the image.  Still, I give it a 7', '2006-07-17 07:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2629045, 362399, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice use of a common, mundane item.  Like the black and white.  Nice angle too.</td>', 'Nice use of a common, mundane item.  Like the black and white.  Nice angle too.', '2006-07-17 07:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2629046, 361954, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very good perspective here.  Ordinarily I would not like the splitting in half of the image, but in this case it works very well.  Great color saturation.  9</td>', 'Very good perspective here.  Ordinarily I would not like the splitting in half of the image, but in this case it works very well.  Great color saturation.  9', '2006-07-17 07:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2629049, 362321, 35602, '<td valign="top">Image seems a bit bland.  Not sure if it is the angle you chose or what, but instead of showing the wall straight on, I think a bit more slanted and moving away from the camera might be better.  The power lines do not add anything to the image.</td>', 'Image seems a bit bland.  Not sure if it is the angle you chose or what, but instead of showing the wall straight on, I think a bit more slanted and moving away from the camera might be better.  The power lines do not add anything to the image.', '2006-07-17 07:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2629053, 362048, 35602, '<td valign="top">Lovely contrast between the yellow and the blue.  Your exposure was pretty good.  Image is too sparse, though.  Seems that it may not be enough, or maybe subject leaves a bit to be desired.  I guess when I think of perspective and sunflowers, I think of a field of sunflowers running from the camera, not just one sunflower.</td>', 'Lovely contrast between the yellow and the blue.  Your exposure was pretty good.  Image is too sparse, though.  Seems that it may not be enough, or maybe subject leaves a bit to be desired.  I guess when I think of perspective and sunflowers, I think of a field of sunflowers running from the camera, not just one sunflower.', '2006-07-17 07:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2629057, 362260, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic sky.  Not enough power towers, though, to get a really dramatic perspective shot.</td>', 'Very dramatic sky.  Not enough power towers, though, to get a really dramatic perspective shot.', '2006-07-17 07:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2629059, 361644, 35602, '<td valign="top">I like the thought on this one.  Leading the eye into the scene by using the perspective of the stairs and the fence is a good technique.  Image is lacking in sharpness, though.  So I give you high marks for composition, but focus and exposure could use some work, and color seems a bit off.</td>', 'I like the thought on this one.  Leading the eye into the scene by using the perspective of the stairs and the fence is a good technique.  Image is lacking in sharpness, though.  So I give you high marks for composition, but focus and exposure could use some work, and color seems a bit off.', '2006-07-17 07:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2629061, 362089, 35602, '<td valign="top">Looks like dead time.  Anyway, I know you were trying to capture the perspective of the fingers and the shadow, but the person is unnaturally positioned.  On the back may have seemed a better choice.  As to the use of the light on the fingers, that was very solid and strong.</td>', 'Looks like dead time.  Anyway, I know you were trying to capture the perspective of the fingers and the shadow, but the person is unnaturally positioned.  On the back may have seemed a better choice.  As to the use of the light on the fingers, that was very solid and strong.', '2006-07-17 08:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2629063, 362460, 35602, '<td valign="top">Would have liked a more shallow dof, so that the background was not detailed at all.  Takes away from the main subject.</td>', 'Would have liked a more shallow dof, so that the background was not detailed at all.  Takes away from the main subject.', '2006-07-17 08:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2629066, 362126, 35602, '<td valign="top">Like the perspective of this one.  Nice placement of power lines and I live the way you descended the towers in perfect synchronization.  This is a good pic of this subject.  8</td>', 'Like the perspective of this one.  Nice placement of power lines and I live the way you descended the towers in perfect synchronization.  This is a good pic of this subject.  8', '2006-07-17 08:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
