(2630005, 361238, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and colors but I am not as fond of the composition, too centered for my taste.  6 from me</td>', 'Nice DOF and colors but I am not as fond of the composition, too centered for my taste.  6 from me', '2006-07-17 13:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2630010, 362200, 27482, '<td valign="top">Love this shot, great colors and composition, something that really strikes me as funny about that lone guy in the rowboats looking at all those empty ones :)</td>', 'Love this shot, great colors and composition, something that really strikes me as funny about that lone guy in the rowboats looking at all those empty ones :)', '2006-07-17 13:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2630016, 361616, 27482, '<td valign="top">I am not really all that fond of the bar that is over her hand leading to the look like she has a brown mark on her hand, just something that really put´s me off this shot.  Not really crazy about the composition either, think that all that room over her head is abundant.  Like the lighting though and clarity.</td>', 'I am not really all that fond of the bar that is over her hand leading to the look like she has a brown mark on her hand, just something that really put´s me off this shot.  Not really crazy about the composition either, think that all that room over her head is abundant.  Like the lighting though and clarity.', '2006-07-17 13:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2630017, 361546, 27482, '<td valign="top">Wish the image quality were better, image seems a bit soft (especially the eyes) and if it were crystal clear and had more contrast I would have liked it much better.</td>', 'Wish the image quality were better, image seems a bit soft (especially the eyes) and if it were crystal clear and had more contrast I would have liked it much better.', '2006-07-17 13:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2630019, 362505, 27482, '<td valign="top">Wish this was clearer, the lack of focus (or at least sharpness that might be lost due to this being shot through glass?) really hurts this image.  4 from me.</td>', 'Wish this was clearer, the lack of focus (or at least sharpness that might be lost due to this being shot through glass?) really hurts this image.  4 from me.', '2006-07-17 13:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2630031, 362358, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I for one am not really all that fond of the half face composition, I normally like it but here it just isn´t working for me, I feel like I am looking at half a photograph.  Not bad though so I gave it a 5.</td>', 'Sorry, I for one am not really all that fond of the half face composition, I normally like it but here it just isn´t working for me, I feel like I am looking at half a photograph.  Not bad though so I gave it a 5.', '2006-07-17 13:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2630037, 361157, 27482, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool, love the wideangle composition, nice work.  7</td>', 'This is pretty cool, love the wideangle composition, nice work.  7', '2006-07-17 13:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2630042, 362437, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well you are definately one that can make centered composition work, works nicely here and this is a pretty cool photo.  Maybe I am just too people oriented but I feel that there is something missing, like a person walking down that road or something like that.  Also, a bit too dramatic and dark for my taste but nothing that is really hurting the shot, I am just in too much of a summer mood for this right now as it reminds me of autumn storms.  Anyway, a nice shot, I gave it a 7.</td>', 'Well you are definately one that can make centered composition work, works nicely here and this is a pretty cool photo.  Maybe I am just too people oriented but I feel that there is something missing, like a person walking down that road or something like that.  Also, a bit too dramatic and dark for my taste but nothing that is really hurting the shot, I am just in too much of a summer mood for this right now as it reminds me of autumn storms.  Anyway, a nice shot, I gave it a 7.', '2006-07-17 14:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
