(2632372, 361684, 27482, '<td valign="top">I voted this a 3 and I make a habit out of explaining why when I vote so low.  Image quality is the main factor here, the CA (purple fringing) and softness in this photo+blown highlights are the main reason why I voted so low.  Also I am not a fan of abstract shots and generally dislike them, so that may also be a reason.  And yes, I am not voting in abstract food, I would never do that to myself :P</td>', 'I voted this a 3 and I make a habit out of explaining why when I vote so low.  Image quality is the main factor here, the CA (purple fringing) and softness in this photo+blown highlights are the main reason why I voted so low.  Also I am not a fan of abstract shots and generally dislike them, so that may also be a reason.  And yes, I am not voting in abstract food, I would never do that to myself :P', '2006-07-18 06:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
