(2632381, 359558, 27482, '<td valign="top">Usually I don´t care about slanted horizons when they are minimal but here I feel the horizon and sky are the main subjects and the slanted horizon bugs me a little, wish you had rotated it this time.  Nice shot other than that, gave it a 6.</td>', 'Usually I don´t care about slanted horizons when they are minimal but here I feel the horizon and sky are the main subjects and the slanted horizon bugs me a little, wish you had rotated it this time.  Nice shot other than that, gave it a 6.', '2006-07-18 06:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632384, 361958, 27524, '<td valign="top">Great contrast between blak sky and white fountain. Beautiful.</td>', 'Great contrast between blak sky and white fountain. Beautiful.', '2006-07-18 06:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632385, 361944, 27482, '<td valign="top">A bit too dark and bland for my taste, think you took this a little too late in the day, a little earlier would have lead to more intense colors in the sky, that or a longer exposure time.  4 from me.</td>', 'A bit too dark and bland for my taste, think you took this a little too late in the day, a little earlier would have lead to more intense colors in the sky, that or a longer exposure time.  4 from me.', '2006-07-18 06:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632392, 362033, 27482, '<td valign="top">I can´t help but compare this shot to this one as I am 99% sure it´s taken at the same location but from the other way around.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=122188" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/278/thumb/122188.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/278/thumb/122188.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/278/thumb/122188.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Compared to this shot, your´s doesn´t really measure up, the composition is just not working as well, too centered and no lines leading the eye towards anything wich is a shame as the location surely gives that opportunity.  Not a bad shot at all though, gave it a 5, there is just simply nothing that blows me away but nothing wrong with it.</td>', 'I can´t help but compare this shot to this one as I am 99% sure it´s taken at the same location but from the other way around.   Compared to this shot, your´s doesn´t really measure up, the composition is just not working as well, too centered and no lines leading the eye towards anything wich is a shame as the location surely gives that opportunity.  Not a bad shot at all though, gave it a 5, there is just simply nothing that blows me away but nothing wrong with it.', '2006-07-18 06:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632393, 362238, 27524, '<td valign="top">Perfectly beautiful. The light and shades have good play. Maximum rating.</td>', 'Perfectly beautiful. The light and shades have good play. Maximum rating.', '2006-07-18 06:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632394, 360872, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice, love the composition here, works nicely.  Great moment too, must be taken during a fun family summer vactation.  7 from me.</td>', 'Nice, love the composition here, works nicely.  Great moment too, must be taken during a fun family summer vactation.  7 from me.', '2006-07-18 06:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632397, 359497, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice work, love the look of the image, the color composition and the actual composition, well framed.  Only nitpick is I wish the sky were just a hint darker, but that´s hard with basic editing so I didn´t deduct any points.  8 from me, I really like this shot.</td>', 'Nice work, love the look of the image, the color composition and the actual composition, well framed.  Only nitpick is I wish the sky were just a hint darker, but that´s hard with basic editing so I didn´t deduct any points.  8 from me, I really like this shot.', '2006-07-18 06:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632398, 362190, 27524, '<td valign="top">I find it nice done. Though blue background are bit too distracting.</td>', 'I find it nice done. Though blue background are bit too distracting.', '2006-07-18 06:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632401, 361692, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad but compared to the recent archictecture winner this doesn´t just measure up.  The composition just doesn´t work as well here in leading they eye throught the frame, here it just seems to me like the bridge is in the way and I want it out of there so I can enjoy a lovely view of what I assume is your city.  Like I said though, not a bad shot at all, above average and I gave it a 6.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=339580" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/500/thumb/339580.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/500/thumb/339580.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/500/thumb/339580.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Not bad but compared to the recent archictecture winner this doesn´t just measure up.  The composition just doesn´t work as well here in leading they eye throught the frame, here it just seems to me like the bridge is in the way and I want it out of there so I can enjoy a lovely view of what I assume is your city.  Like I said though, not a bad shot at all, above average and I gave it a 6. ', '2006-07-18 06:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2632402, 360693, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well maybe not in this particular picture but DEFINATELY an eyesore, hate those things when taking landscape photos, blah :P</td>', 'Well maybe not in this particular picture but DEFINATELY an eyesore, hate those things when taking landscape photos, blah :P', '2006-07-18 06:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
