(2632422, 361189, 35602, '<td valign="top">Depends upon if you are the one who drank it.  Very good detail and exposure.  No blown highlights.  Maybe some noise around the label, but a nice take on the challenge.</td>', 'Depends upon if you are the one who drank it.  Very good detail and exposure.  No blown highlights.  Maybe some noise around the label, but a nice take on the challenge.', '2006-07-18 07:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
