(2633189, 361081, 37334, '<td valign="top">Great find! A wonderful, moody image. Love the colour cast. I also love the way the image is divided into light and dark - ie it''s not the usual straight divide (if that makes sense?) I would love to see a little more light on the rocks in the foreground, but appreciate this is basic editing;)10</td>', 'Great find! A wonderful, moody image. Love the colour cast. I also love the way the image is divided into light and dark - ie it''s not the usual straight divide (if that makes sense?) I would love to see a little more light on the rocks in the foreground, but appreciate this is basic editing;)10', '2006-07-18 13:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2633191, 360169, 8759, '<td valign="top">Don''t see anything new but it''s a nice and clean shot.</td>', 'Don''t see anything new but it''s a nice and clean shot.', '2006-07-18 13:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
