(2633384, 362211, 50127, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked this shot a lot more if it was from the other direction- from the head down.  I feel like Im looking up her nose :(  Also, the fact that I cant see her belly button really is bugging me...<br/>Good lighting.<br/>I wish I could see more of the black fabric that is on her arm.</td>', 'I think I would have liked this shot a lot more if it was from the other direction- from the head down.  I feel like Im looking up her nose :(  Also, the fact that I cant see her belly button really is bugging me...Good lighting.I wish I could see more of the black fabric that is on her arm.', '2006-07-18 15:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2633395, 361644, 16402, '<td valign="top">I think it could be cropped a bit tigher from the top.</td>', 'I think it could be cropped a bit tigher from the top.', '2006-07-18 15:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2633409, 361742, 28820, '<td valign="top">Great title!  Nice contrast in the photo.</td>', 'Great title!  Nice contrast in the photo.', '2006-07-18 15:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2633439, 362519, 50127, '<td valign="top">chicago! I didnt know those things could shoot OUT water.. huh..<br/>I love this photo, the b/w really works and it so interesting.  It almost looks like the water is wrapping around the structure towards the left, which is obviously not possible, but it makes you really look to try and figure it out.</td>', 'chicago! I didnt know those things could shoot OUT water.. huh..I love this photo, the b/w really works and it so interesting.  It almost looks like the water is wrapping around the structure towards the left, which is obviously not possible, but it makes you really look to try and figure it out.', '2006-07-18 16:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2633463, 362026, 55199, '<td valign="top">Your lighting is very interesting.  Seems almost like a negative, yet, I don''t think it is, at least not completely.  The bottoms of the columns look a bit over sharpened.  Interesting effect.  :)</td>', 'Your lighting is very interesting.  Seems almost like a negative, yet, I don''t think it is, at least not completely.  The bottoms of the columns look a bit over sharpened.  Interesting effect.  :)', '2006-07-18 16:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2633473, 362078, 55199, '<td valign="top">The idea is good and there is a lot of potential here.  I wish that there were something in particular with a crisp focus.  The focal area seems way down the train, but the people back there are too small to be very interesting.</td>', 'The idea is good and there is a lot of potential here.  I wish that there were something in particular with a crisp focus.  The focal area seems way down the train, but the people back there are too small to be very interesting.', '2006-07-18 16:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2633483, 360373, 55199, '<td valign="top">Wish there were something more here.  My eyes go to the dark shadow under the shrub, but the shadow holds no interest for me.</td>', 'Wish there were something more here.  My eyes go to the dark shadow under the shrub, but the shadow holds no interest for me.', '2006-07-18 16:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2633493, 362336, 55199, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting and DOF. :)  Not sure about the composition... my eyes don''t want to stay on the mite in focus; they travel up the stem and land on the mites on the petals.  Very nice otherwise.</td>', 'I really like the lighting and DOF. :)  Not sure about the composition... my eyes don''t want to stay on the mite in focus; they travel up the stem and land on the mites on the petals.  Very nice otherwise.', '2006-07-18 16:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2633499, 361079, 55199, '<td valign="top">I think this would score much better if you hadn''t flipped it.</td>', 'I think this would score much better if you hadn''t flipped it.', '2006-07-18 16:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
