(2635204, 362306, 48228, '<td valign="top">I was just so very proud of myself, and this shot, so I am just so pleased I entered it into a challenge, and it did as well as this. <br/>It may not look like perspective to many voters, but it definaltely is, when I studied "Perspective" at art colledge. <br/>It is more the up-close and in your face type of "perspective". <br/>Nearly all plants are formed with "perspective" lines, and shape. <br/>Thank you everyone who added a comment, and also votes, as it is always very much appriciated.....<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-19 00:49:49.</i></td>', 'I was just so very proud of myself, and this shot, so I am just so pleased I entered it into a challenge, and it did as well as this. It may not look like perspective to many voters, but it definaltely is, when I studied "Perspective" at art colledge. It is more the up-close and in your face type of "perspective". Nearly all plants are formed with "perspective" lines, and shape. Thank you everyone who added a comment, and also votes, as it is always very much appriciated.....', '2006-07-19 01:48:20.000000', '2006-07-19 01:49:49.000000', 0),
