(2635704, 361958, 18011, '<td valign="top">Sorry for aberration... it''s impossible to avoid that lighting effects in a square with many artificial lights...<br/>The risk with a circular fisheye like mine is to include undesired subject... it''s very difficult!<br/> <br/>Ciao da Gipo ;-D</td>', 'Sorry for aberration... it''s impossible to avoid that lighting effects in a square with many artificial lights...The risk with a circular fisheye like mine is to include undesired subject... it''s very difficult! Ciao da Gipo ;-D', '2006-07-19 03:08:05.000000', NULL, 0),
