(2636910, 362456, 20056, '<td valign="top">First, congrats for your outstanding picture and your overall great work, your are in my favourite list.<br/> <br/>Just a question: The people that are complaining about dust, why they do not use olympus (or panasonic now)? I can read in your comments that it IS a big issue for You.<br/> <br/>I understand that You have made some investment but would You have changed your mind if somebody told/showed to You before about the problem of the dust?<br/> <br/>B. regards and keep me happy sharing your photos :)</td>', 'First, congrats for your outstanding picture and your overall great work, your are in my favourite list. Just a question: The people that are complaining about dust, why they do not use olympus (or panasonic now)? I can read in your comments that it IS a big issue for You. I understand that You have made some investment but would You have changed your mind if somebody told/showed to You before about the problem of the dust? B. regards and keep me happy sharing your photos :)', '2006-07-19 10:17:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2636917, 361885, 27482, '<td valign="top">I stand by what I said earlier, that is one wierd looking horse, I suggest you take another self portrait with the same technique, that´s something I would want to see :)  Congrats mate!</td>', 'I stand by what I said earlier, that is one wierd looking horse, I suggest you take another self portrait with the same technique, that´s something I would want to see :)  Congrats mate!', '2006-07-19 10:18:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(2636971, 362081, 4226, '<td valign="top">since I ride quiet often, I can imagine what a nightmare it is for the rider. these treads are huge, can be easily handled in a car, but on a bike its dangerous. I am glad that the rider survived.</td>', 'since I ride quiet often, I can imagine what a nightmare it is for the rider. these treads are huge, can be easily handled in a car, but on a bike its dangerous. I am glad that the rider survived.', '2006-07-19 10:36:00.000000', NULL, 0),
