(2637156, 360648, 34192, '<td valign="top">I love the POV and the DOF.  Think this is a very well taken image.  Only thing I think might make a difference would be the use of curves and/or shadow/highlight to bring out a little more contrast.  I''d like to see the bricks darker to emhasize the lines they form - it adds to the overall pattern.  Well done, just a touch flat.</td>', 'I love the POV and the DOF.  Think this is a very well taken image.  Only thing I think might make a difference would be the use of curves and/or shadow/highlight to bring out a little more contrast.  I''d like to see the bricks darker to emhasize the lines they form - it adds to the overall pattern.  Well done, just a touch flat.', '2006-07-19 11:09:06.000000', NULL, 0),
