(2637189, 360365, 34192, '<td valign="top">I agree with your husband. :)  this, to me, is a better overall image - it has much more personality. Voters are just really odd.  I wouldn''t take it as a statement on the quality of the image.  BTW - DOF, focus, POV are all excellent.  Colors work really well.  Had I voted this challenge I would have given it at least a 7.  More creative than the endless buildings (one of which I submitted and thought REALLY boring).</td>', 'I agree with your husband. :)  this, to me, is a better overall image - it has much more personality. Voters are just really odd.  I wouldn''t take it as a statement on the quality of the image.  BTW - DOF, focus, POV are all excellent.  Colors work really well.  Had I voted this challenge I would have given it at least a 7.  More creative than the endless buildings (one of which I submitted and thought REALLY boring).', '2006-07-19 11:13:14.000000', NULL, 0),
