(2637373, 359968, 41008, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Kemptonreporter:</b></div><hr/><i> This is a photo-journalist style of photo.<br/>That''s the only reason why I''m letting you get away with that horribly tilted horizon.<br/>Plus the contrast between the little guy and the big guy is kinda cool...<br/>Good luck! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>That''s not a tilted horizon... it''s a hill.<br/> <br/>This does a great job of making a play on perspective. The younger boy seems farther away than he really is because of the tilt of the hill and his small size.<br/> <br/>I still think this is a great capture.</td>', 'Originally posted by Kemptonreporter: This is a photo-journalist style of photo.That''s the only reason why I''m letting you get away with that horribly tilted horizon.Plus the contrast between the little guy and the big guy is kinda cool...Good luck!   That''s not a tilted horizon... it''s a hill. This does a great job of making a play on perspective. The younger boy seems farther away than he really is because of the tilt of the hill and his small size. I still think this is a great capture.', '2006-07-19 11:44:12.000000', NULL, 0),
