(2639187, 362289, 37961, '<td valign="top">Love how you put poems or song titles with your pics. Really gives them alot more meaning. I need to start doing that!<br/> <br/>I guess what I like most about this is the way the clouds are really dense at the top of the photo, and they open up to reveal the blue sky further out. Really good hues/tones. Did you take this yourself?</td>', 'Love how you put poems or song titles with your pics. Really gives them alot more meaning. I need to start doing that! I guess what I like most about this is the way the clouds are really dense at the top of the photo, and they open up to reveal the blue sky further out. Really good hues/tones. Did you take this yourself?', '2006-07-19 18:41:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(2639296, 362081, 27763, '<td valign="top">A powerful image, for sure.</td>', 'A powerful image, for sure.', '2006-07-19 18:57:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2639488, 360586, 43088, '<td valign="top">Wow!  My first Top Ten! Amongst all the photographers here that is indeed an honor!  I was passing by this location on my way home and it caught my eye for the lightning. The underside of the bridge was lit by reflections off the water.  It was not that interesting in its normal view but was much more interesting when I turned it upside down.  I increased contrast to make it more dramatic. You do not need a DSLR to get good photos (and I don''t have to worry about carrying as much gear!)</td>', 'Wow!  My first Top Ten! Amongst all the photographers here that is indeed an honor!  I was passing by this location on my way home and it caught my eye for the lightning. The underside of the bridge was lit by reflections off the water.  It was not that interesting in its normal view but was much more interesting when I turned it upside down.  I increased contrast to make it more dramatic. You do not need a DSLR to get good photos (and I don''t have to worry about carrying as much gear!)', '2006-07-19 19:30:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(2639495, 361604, 22301, '<td valign="top">sweet angle/perspective. Great shot, this is why I have you in my favorite photographers :).</td>', 'sweet angle/perspective. Great shot, this is why I have you in my favorite photographers :).', '2006-07-19 19:32:21.000000', NULL, 0),
