(2639702, 361205, 30982, '<td valign="top">The empty sky is what draws my eye first here, but then it drops me down to the path.  Good classic composition within the frame.  Seems a bit empty - one would expect a human or two, but in a way it represents a society where despite the housing being so close, the people stay hidden inside.  Or it could just be during the work day and no one''s home.  :-)</td>', 'The empty sky is what draws my eye first here, but then it drops me down to the path.  Good classic composition within the frame.  Seems a bit empty - one would expect a human or two, but in a way it represents a society where despite the housing being so close, the people stay hidden inside.  Or it could just be during the work day and no one''s home.  :-)', '2006-07-19 20:23:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(2639706, 362115, 30982, '<td valign="top">How in the world did you get this shot?  The detail on the eye is excellent - I never knew giraffes had such beautiful eyelashes.  Thanks for sharing a perspective most don''t get to see!</td>', 'How in the world did you get this shot?  The detail on the eye is excellent - I never knew giraffes had such beautiful eyelashes.  Thanks for sharing a perspective most don''t get to see!', '2006-07-19 20:25:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(2639714, 362501, 30982, '<td valign="top">She really is indeed too cute!  Made me smile the minute I opened the picture.  Love how the perspective you chose makes her feet look so tiny in comparison.  Sweet picture - I''m sure her parents love it!</td>', 'She really is indeed too cute!  Made me smile the minute I opened the picture.  Love how the perspective you chose makes her feet look so tiny in comparison.  Sweet picture - I''m sure her parents love it!', '2006-07-19 20:26:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(2639781, 359097, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice, classic perspective shot.  The soft, warm colors are very inviting and impart a peaceful feeling.  My only nit is the "cutoff" balcony, but I''m not sure how you could have framed it any differently than you did, except to move one door down.</td>', 'Nice, classic perspective shot.  The soft, warm colors are very inviting and impart a peaceful feeling.  My only nit is the "cutoff" balcony, but I''m not sure how you could have framed it any differently than you did, except to move one door down.', '2006-07-19 20:50:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2639846, 361974, 29156, '<td valign="top">sooooo beautiful</td>', 'sooooo beautiful', '2006-07-19 21:13:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2639895, 361456, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nicely seen and captured, and I like the description behind the title.  Mostly I like your description of your workflow - that''s why I have the "History" thing turned on in Photoshop - I''d never be able to remember what I do sometimes!  The blue is indeed a sort of electric blue, but it suits this photograph just fine.</td>', 'Nicely seen and captured, and I like the description behind the title.  Mostly I like your description of your workflow - that''s why I have the "History" thing turned on in Photoshop - I''d never be able to remember what I do sometimes!  The blue is indeed a sort of electric blue, but it suits this photograph just fine.', '2006-07-19 21:28:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(2639907, 360293, 30982, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get a chance to vote in this challenge, but I do like your "perspective" on the plant growing where it probably shouldn''t.  I suspect it was hard for folks to interpret that without really taking the time to look and think about it.  Very crisp focus and nice cool colors!</td>', 'I didn''t get a chance to vote in this challenge, but I do like your "perspective" on the plant growing where it probably shouldn''t.  I suspect it was hard for folks to interpret that without really taking the time to look and think about it.  Very crisp focus and nice cool colors!', '2006-07-19 21:31:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(2640056, 362132, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very good macro!  Love the colors and it is indeed an interesting perspective.</td>', 'Very good macro!  Love the colors and it is indeed an interesting perspective.', '2006-07-19 21:57:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2640083, 362540, 8891, '<td valign="top">I think you found a great subject for the perspective challenge. The building has great lines and curves and I might have concentrated more or chose an unencumbered area of the architecture and gone with that. From what I can see, the best part might have been where the face was in the mid lower center. I am just imagining the rest of the face on the split levels and curves on a nice angle showing the lines recede up, down or diagonally. Great colors in this as it is but the noise seems to have been noticed a bit.</td>', 'I think you found a great subject for the perspective challenge. The building has great lines and curves and I might have concentrated more or chose an unencumbered area of the architecture and gone with that. From what I can see, the best part might have been where the face was in the mid lower center. I am just imagining the rest of the face on the split levels and curves on a nice angle showing the lines recede up, down or diagonally. Great colors in this as it is but the noise seems to have been noticed a bit.', '2006-07-19 22:07:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2640197, 362238, 48560, '<td valign="top">D''oh! If only you were 0.08 points higher, we could be messing with Judi''s profile instead right now, LOL! Yes, I got punished too (see my profile, sobs) for being on your side. Lets try it again next time :p<br/> <br/>As for the photo - I really like the dramatic sky. The exposure on the building is really nice, esp the part where part of it is darker and gradually brightens. Cool effect.<br/> <br/>crayon</td>', 'D''oh! If only you were 0.08 points higher, we could be messing with Judi''s profile instead right now, LOL! Yes, I got punished too (see my profile, sobs) for being on your side. Lets try it again next time :p As for the photo - I really like the dramatic sky. The exposure on the building is really nice, esp the part where part of it is darker and gradually brightens. Cool effect. crayon', '2006-07-19 22:35:42.000000', NULL, 0),
