(2640344, 359764, 32754, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on top 20 finish...I liked the sepia, perspective of the lights and composition of this shot.</td>', 'Congratulations on top 20 finish...I liked the sepia, perspective of the lights and composition of this shot.', '2006-07-19 23:00:49.000000', NULL, 0),
