(2649736, 361783, 55642, '<td valign="top">Hi Gunnar-<br/> <br/>I think levyj413 nailed it - there isn''t much here that''s taking advantage of perspective to make a dramatic photo. The composition doesn''t seem to have much 3-dimensionality to it. I''m not sure why the hiker was included in the composition. In my opinion including the hiker actually works against the photo, makes it looks much more like a quick snapshot rather than a perspective landscape.</td>', 'Hi Gunnar- I think levyj413 nailed it - there isn''t much here that''s taking advantage of perspective to make a dramatic photo. The composition doesn''t seem to have much 3-dimensionality to it. I''m not sure why the hiker was included in the composition. In my opinion including the hiker actually works against the photo, makes it looks much more like a quick snapshot rather than a perspective landscape.', '2006-07-22 20:16:44.000000', NULL, 0),
