(2650494, 361596, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like the angle;  I have something similar in my portfolio, in fact:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=358371" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60862/thumb/358371.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60862/thumb/358371.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60862/thumb/358371.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>But note the differences:  you don''t want to crop out the top of her head unless you''re way in close, the background is toned down, etc.<br/> <br/>With all that said, though, I gave you a 5.<br/> <br/>Keep shooting your adorable girl from interesting angles (for example, at her height or from below), and you''re sure to get some winners! :)</td>', 'I like the angle;  I have something similar in my portfolio, in fact:  But note the differences:  you don''t want to crop out the top of her head unless you''re way in close, the background is toned down, etc. With all that said, though, I gave you a 5. Keep shooting your adorable girl from interesting angles (for example, at her height or from below), and you''re sure to get some winners! :)', '2006-07-23 03:29:34.000000', NULL, 0),
