(2653941, 362540, 55956, '<td valign="top">* Greetings from Critique Club *<br/> <br/>Hi, there are some aspects in this image that I liken''t. <br/>1) The noise, too much for obtain a nice image. Under exposure? great crop?<br/>2) The shot is oblique<br/>3) there is a geometrical distortion, this is nice in some photograph but here don''t work<br/>4) there isn''t a clean subject <br/> <br/>I think that the location is good for obtain nice images.<br/>Many auguries for the future releases.<br/>Best Regards<br/>Gennaro<br/></td>', '* Greetings from Critique Club * Hi, there are some aspects in this image that I liken''t. 1) The noise, too much for obtain a nice image. Under exposure? great crop?2) The shot is oblique3) there is a geometrical distortion, this is nice in some photograph but here don''t work4) there isn''t a clean subject  I think that the location is good for obtain nice images.Many auguries for the future releases.Best RegardsGennaro', '2006-07-24 06:26:03.000000', NULL, 0),
