(2905190, 362358, 34192, '<td valign="top">Another image I think is great as it is.  I don''t need the full face - I have enough to build the rest in my mind - isn''t that what photography is about - the viewer ''finishing the image?''  In voting, I think this image also suffers from the challenge it was entered in and would have scored much higher in a better suited challenge.  DPC voters are a literal bunch.  If it doesn''t punch them in the eye, most don''t take the time to consider possibilities.  This image is full of possibilities.  Very well taken and edited.</td>', 'Another image I think is great as it is.  I don''t need the full face - I have enough to build the rest in my mind - isn''t that what photography is about - the viewer ''finishing the image?''  In voting, I think this image also suffers from the challenge it was entered in and would have scored much higher in a better suited challenge.  DPC voters are a literal bunch.  If it doesn''t punch them in the eye, most don''t take the time to consider possibilities.  This image is full of possibilities.  Very well taken and edited.', '2006-10-07 08:04:54.000000', NULL, 0),
