(4955380, 362373, 69008, '<td valign="top">This is a special perspective in this shot. I have one very similar, shot with a Sony Handicam, in Macon. I was fortunate enough to have a southern belle in an antebellum dress drifting across the floor at the bottom, and no table.  The belle helped a lot to put the elements into place about where the shot was taken.</td>', 'This is a special perspective in this shot. I have one very similar, shot with a Sony Handicam, in Macon. I was fortunate enough to have a southern belle in an antebellum dress drifting across the floor at the bottom, and no table.  The belle helped a lot to put the elements into place about where the shot was taken.', '2008-09-15 00:29:30.000000', NULL, 0),
